ction: \"一枚戒指\".\n\nQ055 correction: \"击杀鲜血大师才是正确的选择\". claim_type DIRECTION (reversed action). target_span \"放走鲜血大师\".\n\nQ057 correction: \"重新加载/重新生成区域和关卡\". claim_type VALUE. target_span \"地图和角色\".\n\nQ058 correction: \"在 Lua 中查看 [抛射物]\". claim_type ADDITION (or CONDITION). target_span \"即使此处没有抛射物，也可\".\n\nQ059 correction: \"通过裂解清除敌人身上的89个增益效果\" (remove 必须单次). target_span \"必须单次\". claim_type CONDITION.\n\nQ060 correction: \"选择半身人种族并杀死自己。\" claim_type DIRECTION. target_span \"并杀死敌人\".\n\nQ049 correction: remove 始终: \"当你用右键拖动画出鼠标手势时，会显示颜色编码的轨迹。#WHITE#\". verdict UNCERTAIN, claim_type ADDITION.\n\nQ052 correction: \"它们胜利了，但是现在它们又在哪里呢？\" verdict UNCERTAIN, claim_type ADDITION.\n\nQ056 correction: \"才发现那副庞大而破旧的战甲里其实是一个人类。\" claim_type REFERENT.\n\nOrder Q041..Q060. Output JSON only."}}
