{"type":"message_end","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Let me go through each item.\n\nQ041: source \"Accept these selections\" (a button label in trap selection dialog). Target \"确认法术选择\" — \"Confirm spell selection\". Issues: \"traps\" translated as \"法术\" (spells) — source context is about traps. Also \"Accept\" → \"确认\" is fine-ish, but \"selections\" of traps → \"法术选择\". FINDING: traps vs spells. Also \"Accept\" means accept these selections; target says \"确认\" which is acceptable-ish. Main defect: traps→法术. claim_type VALUE/OTHER. target_span \"法术选择\", evidence \"Accept these selections\" — the evidence for trap comes from source_context (self.traps_selected, \"Preparing trap\"). Evidence must be verbatim from source or source_context. Use \"traps_selected\" or \"Preparing trap with normal trigger.\" Better: evidence \"You cannot prepare more than %d traps.\" Use that.\n\nQ042: \"Got to level 10 of the infinite dungeon.\" Target \"到达无尽地下城第10层。\" Accurate. candidates empty.\n\nQ043: \"THAT'S NOT A VERY HERMIT-LIKE ATTITUDE.\" Target \"这可不像我这个隐士该有的态度。\" — \"my hermit attitude\" — source says \"not a very hermit-like attitude\" — target adds \"我这个\" but that's compatible (the speaker is the hermit). Not an objective defect. Empty.\n\nQ044: source \"Have 100 walls...\" target \"让淤泥巢穴中的 200 面墙...\" — 100 vs 200. FINDING. target_span \"200 面墙\", evidence \"Have 100 walls on the sludgenest turn into hostile creatures.\"\n\nQ045: \"But what is all th...\" target \"但是这一切到底是……\" The source is cut off \"what is all th...\" — target conveys. Fine. Empty.\n\nQ046: \"Killed a Bringer of Doom.\" target \"杀死一名厄运行者。\" \"a Bringer of Doom\" — 厄运行者 is a translation choice. Fine. Empty.\n\nQ047: source about \"your fight with the creature carrying it\" — creature carrying the paper. Target: \"看来在你刚才和那个人类搏斗的时候被打碎了\" — \"the human\"? Source doesn't say human; context: spiders, the matriarch spider, Sun Paladin journal. The creature carrying it — target says \"那个人类\" (that human). That's an addition/misidentification: source context indicates spiders (arachnids), not a human. Hmm, but rule 3: new info compatible with visible evidence and not refutable? The context strongly indicates the creature is a spider (the fight with the matriarch spider, journal says spiders). Target says \"人类\" (human) which contradicts context: \"that spider is the matriarch here\". So FINDING: \"creature\" → \"人类\" contradicts context. claim_type REFERENT. target_span \"和那个人类搏斗\", evidence from source_context: \"that spider is the matriarch here\". Also \"被打碎了\" — paper ruined/打碎? \"ruined from your fight\" — target says paper \"被打碎了\" (shattered) — paper being shattered vs ruined; minor. Also translation: \"对大部分埃亚尔野生生命体有效的信息素在'太阳骑士'这种物种的身上被证明无效\" — fine. \"passive study would lead to great loss\" — \"被动的研究会导致巨大的损失\" fine. \"next step of emigration program should be cleaning of local 'sun paladin' nest and establishment of...\" — \"移民计划的下一步是清理...\" fine. Also quotes: uses \"太阳骑士\" with different quote marks — style. Main finding: 人类.\n\nAlso note: \"sun paladin\" translated as \"太阳骑士\" (Sun Knight?) — conventional translation in ToME Chinese is 太阳骑士 actually (Sun Paladin = 太阳骑士). Fine.\n\nQ048: \"Records of Lorekeeper Hadak part three\" → \"博学者哈达克的记录，第三部分\". Fine. Empty.\n\nQ049: source \"When you do a mouse gesture (right click + drag) a color coded trail is displayed.\" Target: \"当你用右键拖动画出鼠标手势时，始终会显示彩色的轨迹提示。\" — adds \"始终\" (always) — is that supported? The option is \"Display mouse gesture trails\" with hide_gestures toggle; description says when you do a gesture a trail is displayed. Adding \"始终\" (always) is an addition not supported... but rule 3: new info compatible and not refutable by evidence? \"always\" — hmm. The description doesn't say always; it's describing the feature. Actually since the setting toggles display, the base description doesn't claim \"always\". Adding \"始终\" could be considered mis-stating? Hmm. Actually since the setting toggles display, the base description doesn't claim \"always\". \"始终\" implies unconditional, which is arguably contradicted by the toggle (hide_gestures disables). But within this item's text alone, is \"always display\" contradicted? The option name is \"Display mouse gesture trails\" with enabled/disabled. It's plausible the intent: when enabled, always display. Hmm, hard. Also \"color coded\" → \"彩色的\" loses \"color coded\" nuance (颜色编码的). Minor. \"轨迹提示\" adds \"提示\" (hint) — minor addition. I'd report UNCERTAIN on \"始终\" as ADDITION/CONDITION. Actually let me think: is it objective? The source says \"a color coded trail is displayed\" conditional on doing a gesture. Target adds \"always\" — that's added info about the display being always. The setting toggles hide_gestures, meaning trails can be hidden. So \"始终会显示\" contradicts the toggle. Evidence: \"config.settings.hide_gestures = not config.settings.hide_gestures\". I'd give FINDING on 始终? Risky. I'll say UNCERTAIN with CONDITION/ADDITION.\n\nQ050: Long fountain text. Check: target adds \"位于德斯镇\" — \"located in Derth town\"?? Source: \"You see here a large, elaborate fountain\" — no location mentioned. Lore name is \"Angolwen Fountain\" (source_context). Target says 德斯镇 (Derth) — contradicts \"Angolwen Fountain\". But 德斯镇 addition: is it refutable by visible evidence? The lore name \"Angolwen Fountain\" indicates it's in Angolwen, not Derth. So ADDITION contradicted by context. FINDING? The source_context shows name = \"Angolwen Fountain\". Derth is a different town. So the addition \"位于德斯镇\" is refuted. FINDING, claim_type ADDITION or REFERENT. target_span \"位于德斯镇\", evidence \"Angolwen Fountain\".\n\nAlso check rest: \"her arms outstretched to welcome all\" → \"她伸展双臂，欢迎所有人\" fine. \"an elf with a tall, elaborate staff\" fine. \"a halfling with a scepter in one hand and a fireball hovering over the other\" → \"一手握着权杖、另一手上方悬浮火球\" fine. \"in small print\" → \"细小字样\" fine. The carvings: \"ALL ARE WELCOME WHO LEARN FROM THE MISTAKES OF THE PAST\" → \"欢迎所有从过去的错误中吸取教训之人\" fine. \"LET THE ARCANE ONCE MORE BE A BOON AND NOT A BANE TO MAJ'EYAL\" → \"愿奥术再度成为马基·埃亚尔的助益，而非灾祸\" fine. \"MAY WE HAVE THE WISDOM TO ONE DAY REUNITE THE WORLD IN SAFETY AND ENLIGHTENMENT\" → fine. \"GATHER HERE IN PEACE TO DISCOVER AND PERFECT THE KNOWLEDGE OF HOW, AND WHEN, TO WEAVE THE WORLD'S FABRIC\" → \"在此和平相聚，探索并完善何时、如何编织世界织物的知识\" — order swapped (when, how → 何时、如何) but fine. \"repeating along the border\" → \"反复雕着一行\" fine-ish.\n\nQ051: source \"If you bring me a gem and a ring\" — target \"如果你给我找来一颗宝石和一枚项链\" — \"ring\" translated as \"项链\" (necklace/amulet)! That's a VALUE error. Then later \"我可以帮你把宝石的力量镶嵌到戒指里去\" uses 戒指. So 项链 is wrong — should be 戒指. FINDING. target_span \"一枚项链\", evidence \"If you bring me a gem and a ring\".\n\nAlso \"you need a quality ring to use a quality gem\" → \"你得寻找高品质的戒指来用于高品质的宝石\" fine. \"The original traits of the ring will be lost\" → fine. \"There is a small fee dependent on the level of the ring\" fine.\n\nQ052: \"But then where are they now if they won?\" → \"兽人是胜利了，但是现在他们又在哪里呢？\" Adds \"兽人\" (orcs) — source \"they\". Context: Sher'Tuls. Adding \"兽人\" — Sher'Tul are not orcs; they're a lost race. Is this refutable by visible evidence? Context talks about Sher'Tuls who fought the gods. Not stated they're orcs. Hmm, \"兽人\" adds a subject not in source. Visible evidence doesn't state they're orcs; can we judge it wrong? Sher'Tul... external knowledge says they're not orcs, but rule says don't rely on external knowledge. Within visible text: \"Those are Sher'Tuls? They fought the gods?!\" — no orc mention. The addition \"兽人\" is new info... can it be judged wrong by visible evidence? Not directly. Rule 3 says new info compatible with evidence and not judgeable-wrong isn't a defect. But adding a subject not present in source is an addition changing meaning — SUBJECT change. The source \"they\" refers to Sher'Tuls; target asserts orcs. Since evidence doesn't identify them as orcs, and it's a substantive addition... I think this qualifies as ADDITION/SUBJECT FINDING since the subject is explicitly added where source had only a pronoun. Hmm, but rule 3 protects compatible additions. Is \"orcs\" compatible? Ambiguous. I'd report UNCERTAIN with claim_type ADDITION.\n\nQ053: source: \"Return in a few days, and I'll have everything prepared.\" Target: \"几天后你回来，我肯定把一切都准备好了\" fine. \"Oh, take this.\" → \"哦，带上这个。\" fine. \"It opens the ruins of Telmur, which the men of Sholtar sealed many years ago.\" → \"它可以打开泰尔玛废墟，那是多年前肖尔塔人封印的地方。\" fine. \"return with it and your odds of surviving our portal attempt will go up drastically\" → \"请帮我带回来，这能大大提高你通过传送门时存活的几率。\" fine. \" Fear not\" fine. Empty.\n\nQ054: \"I cleared the room of death and all I got was this lousy achievement!\" Target: \"我清完“死亡之屋”后发现我只得到了这个无聊的成就！\" fine (meme reference). Empty.\n\nQ055: \"The Right thing to do\" → \"放走鲜血大师才是正确的选择\" — \"released the Blood Master\"?? Source context: id = \"RING_BLOOD_KILL\", desc \"Did the righteous thing in the ring of blood and disposed of the Blood Master.\" So achievement is for KILLING the Blood Master; target says 放走 (release/spare). FINDING, DIRECTION/ACTION. target_span \"放走鲜血大师\", evidence \"disposed of the Blood Master\".\n\nQ056: source mentions \"it's actually a human inside that hulking, worn armor\" — target: \"才发现那副庞大而破旧的战甲里其实装着弗莉吉亚的弟弟。\" — \"Fryjia's brother\"? Source says \"a human\". Context mentions Fryjia and her father (\"You will understand when you meet her father\"), and valfren-defeat: \"Father... *She stands silent*... You win\". So the armored figure is Fryjia's father, not brother. Target says 弟弟 (younger brother). Evidence: \"You will understand when you meet her father.\" and \"Father...\" Hmm — is that enough to establish the figure is the father? The chat id \"valfren-entry\" — Valfren. Fryjia's father is named Valfren presumably. The defeat text: Fryjia says \"Father...\" right after Valfren collapses. That strongly supports father, contradicting 弟弟. But strictly, does evidence prove the human is her father? The sequence: valfren-entry (armor appears), valfren-defeat (Valfren collapses, Fryjia: \"Father... You win... Prepare for your final battle\"). So Valfren = Father. The armored human = Valfren (entry scene). Target says 弟弟 — contradicted. I'd give FINDING? Or UNCERTAIN? The chain is fairly solid within visible text. I'll say FINDING, REFERENT. target_span \"弗莉吉亚的弟弟\", evidence \"Father... #LIGHT_GREEN#*She stands silent for a few seconds*#WHITE# You win\". Hmm, need verbatim evidence from source_context. The line: \"You close your eyes for a brief instant. Fryjia is there when you open them*\\nFather... #LIGHT_GREEN#*She stands silent for a few seconds*#WHITE# You win, @playerdescriptor.race@.\" Use \"Fryjia is there when you open them\" or simpler \"Father... #LIGHT_GREEN#*She stands silent for a few seconds*#WHITE# You win\". Actually simpler: \"You will understand when you meet her father.\" That's verbatim from source_context. Good — combined with \"Valfren collapses as the light returns\". I'll use evidence: \"Valfren collapses as the light returns to this world\" plus... only one evidence string. Use \"You will understand when you meet her father.\" Hmm, that alone doesn't tie the armored figure. Maybe UNCERTAIN is safer? The correction: 战甲里其实是一个人类（弗莉吉亚的父亲）。The visible context: the defeat chat \"valfren-defeat\" says \"Valfren collapses... Fryjia is there... Father... You win\" — implies Valfren is the father and the one defeated. The entry is \"valfren-entry\" describing the armor. So the human in armor = Valfren = Fryjia's father. I'll mark FINDING with evidence \"Valfren collapses as the light returns to this world\" — hmm, that doesn't mention father. Better combined isn't allowed in one string unless contiguous. The contiguous text: \"#LIGHT_GREEN#*Valfren collapses as the light returns to this world.\\n#LIGHT_GREEN#You close your eyes for a brief instant. Fryjia is there when you open them*\\nFather...\" Not contiguous due to newlines but I can include a multi-line verbatim snippet? Evidence must appear verbatim; newlines included. I could use: \"Fryjia is there when you open them*\\nFather...\" — that includes a newline as in the source_context string. The source_context contains \"Fryjia is there when you open them*\\nFather... #LIGHT_GREEN#*She stands silent\". In the JSON it's actual newline. I'll write evidence with \\n: \"Fryjia is there when you open them*\\nFather...\". That's verbatim.\n\nAlso check other parts of Q056: \"a massive battle armor with an equally massive battle axe\" → \"一副同样手持巨大战斧的巨型战甲\" — \"equally massive\" modifies the axe relative to armor; \"同样手持\" is odd but conveys. \"It wasn't there just a second ago.\" → \"一瞬之前那里还空无一物。\" fine. \"f...t...ma....ll...\" → \"弗……特……玛……尔……\" — transliteration addition, fine (interpreted as syllables). \"extreme emotions invading your very soul\" → \"极端的情绪侵入灵魂，将你彻底淹没\" fine. Also missing line? Source lines all present. OK.\n\nQ057: \"Reload/regenerate Zone and level\" → \"重新加载/重新生成地图和角色\" — \"level\" → \"角色\" (character)?? Should be 层/关卡. \"Zone and level\" — 地图和角色 wrong; 角色 = character. FINDING, VALUE. target_span \"地图和角色\", evidence \"Reload/regenerate Zone and level\".\n\nQ058: \"Lua inspect [Projectile]\" → \"即使此处没有抛射物，也可在 Lua 中查看 [抛射物]\" — addition \"即使此处没有抛射物\" (even if no projectile here). Source is just \"Lua inspect [Projectile]\". This is a substantive addition — the menu item only appears when there is a projectile (if p and config.settings.cheat). So the claim \"even if there's no projectile here\" is contradicted: the entry only appears if p exists. Evidence: \"if p and config.settings.cheat then list[#list+1] = {name=_t\\\"[[SOURCE_MATCH_1]]\\\"...\". FINDING, ADDITION/CONDITION. target_span \"即使此处没有抛射物，也可\", correction \"在 Lua 中查看 [抛射物]\". Evidence: \"if p and config.settings.cheat then\".\n\nQ059: \"Removed 89 beneficial effects from enemies via Disintegration.\" → \"必须单次使用裂解清除敌人身上的89个增益效果\" — adds \"必须单次\" (must in a single use). Source context: can_gain increments nb, track \" / 89\" — cumulative counter, not single use. So \"单次\" is wrong; it's cumulative. Evidence: \"self.nb = (self.nb or 0) + 1\" and track showing cumulative. FINDING, CONDITION/ADDITION. target_span \"必须单次\", evidence \"self.nb = (self.nb or 0) + 1\". Also \"Removed 89\" stated as achievement desc — target phrase \"必须...清除\" turns into requirement; that's a statement change but the desc is descriptive; the 单次 is the key objective defect. Also could note the descriptive→imperative but skip.\n\nQ060: \"Killed oneself as a halfling.\" → \"选择半身人种族并杀死敌人。\" — \"killed oneself\" (suicide) vs \"杀死敌人\" (kill enemies). Achievement \"Fool of a Took!\" id HALFLING_SUICIDE. FINDING, ACTION/DIRECTION. target_span \"并杀死敌人\", evidence \"Killed oneself as a halfling.\" Also \"选择半身人种族\" for \"as a halfling\" — okay. Main: suicide→kill enemy.\n\nNow Q041 more precisely: \"Accept these selections\" — in trap preparation dialog. Target \"确认法术选择\" — \"确认\" for Accept fine; \"法术\" for traps wrong. Also \"these selections\" → \"选择\" fine. FINDING: 法术 vs 陷阱. claim_type VALUE (or REFERENT). evidence: \"You cannot prepare more than %d traps.\" or \"self.traps_selected\". Use \"You cannot prepare more than %d traps.\"\n\nQ049 decision: I'll include UNCERTAIN candidate for 始终, and maybe also \"提示\" addition? That's trivial; skip. Also \"color coded\" → 彩色的: loses \"color coded\" meaning; colors code something. \"彩色的轨迹提示\" — minor. Skip or UNCERTAIN? I'll skip to keep focused; actually it is a small omission of \"coded\". Skip.\n\nQ047: Also \"creature carrying it\" — the paper; target \"在你刚才和那个人类搏斗的时候被打碎了\" — subject shifted to the paper being shattered, and creature → 人类. I'll report the 人类 one. Also maybe \"被打碎了\" — \"ruined\" → 被打碎; paper shattered — minor, skip.\n\nAlso Q047 target: \"对大部分埃亚尔野生生命体有效的信息素在'太阳骑士'这种物种的身上被证明无效\" — source: \"pheromone signals effective on much Eyalite wildlife ineffective on species 'sun paladin.'\" fine. \"next step ... should be cleaning of local 'sun paladin' nest and establishment of...\" → \"移民计划的下一步是清理本地的'太阳骑士'巢穴并建立…\" — \"establishment of...\" truncated, \"并建立…\" ok.\n\nQ043: also check \"这可不像我这个隐士该有的态度\" vs \"THAT'S NOT A VERY HERMIT-LIKE ATTITUDE.\" Fine.\n\nQ052: Let me decide. The target adds 兽人. Source: player asks \"But then where are they now if they won?\" after being told about Sher'Tuls. The NPC says \"They are gone now.\" Adding \"兽人\" as subject — visible evidence never says Sher'Tuls are orcs. Given rule 3, additions not judgeable-wrong are okay, but this one asserts a specific race identity. I'll report UNCERTAIN, ADDITION. Actually hmm — in ToME lore, Sher'Tul are not orcs; orc pride lore is separate in this file (Q048 context is orc history). But external knowledge not allowed. Within visible text, nothing contradicts or confirms. UNCERTAIN.\n\nQ050 德斯镇: evidence \"Angolwen Fountain\" — solid FINDING.\n\nNow compose JSON with 20 items Q041–Q060, each with observation.\n\nLet me write observations concisely (Chinese fine).\n\nItems with empty candidates: Q042, Q043, Q045, Q046, Q048, Q053, Q054.\n\nFINDINGS: Q041, Q044, Q047, Q050, Q051, Q055, Q057, Q058, Q059, Q060. UNCERTAIN: Q049, Q052, Q056(FINDING).\n\nQ056 verdict: I'll go FINDING.\n\nEvidence strings verbatim check:\n\nQ041 evidence: \"You cannot prepare more than %d traps.\" — present in source_context. Good.\n\nQ044 evidence: \"Have 100 walls on the sludgenest turn into hostile creatures.\" — present verbatim in source_context. Good.\n\nQ047 evidence: \"that spider is the matriarch here\" — verbatim in source_context (\"that spider is the matriarch here\"). Yes.\n\nQ050 evidence: \"Angolwen Fountain\" — verbatim. Good.\n\nQ051 evidence: \"If you bring me a gem and a ring\" — verbatim in source. Yes.\n\nQ055 evidence: \"disposed of the Blood Master\" — verbatim. Good.\n\nQ057 evidence: \"Reload/regenerate Zone and level\" — source. Good.\n\nQ058 evidence: \"if p and config.settings.cheat then list[#list+1] = {name=_t\\\"[[SOURCE_MATCH_1]]\\\"\" — verbatim? source_context: \"if p and config.settings.cheat then list[#list+1] = {name=_t\\\"[[SOURCE_MATCH_1]]\\\", action=\\\"debug-inspect\\\"...\" — In JSON the quote is escaped \\\" but the actual string contains \". I'll write: \"if p and config.settings.cheat then\" — simpler, verbatim.\n\nQ059 evidence: \"self.nb = (self.nb or 0) + 1\" — verbatim. Also could use track \"/ 89\". Use \"self.nb = (self.nb or 0) + 1\".\n\nQ060 evidence: \"Killed oneself as a halfling.\" — source verbatim.\n\nQ049 evidence: \"config.settings.hide_gestures = not config.settings.hide_gestures\" — verbatim.\n\nQ052: no evidence pinpoints orc; but evidence field required. Use source text \"But then where are they now if they won?\" and context \"Those are Sher'Tuls? They fought the gods?!\" as evidence showing subject is Sher'Tul. Use that.\n\nQ056 evidence: \"Fryjia is there when you open them*\\nFather...\" — the source_context has \"*She stands silent...\" hmm the exact: \"Fryjia is there when you open them*\\nFather... #LIGHT_GREEN#*She stands silent for a few seconds*#WHITE# You win, @playerdescriptor.race@.\" So evidence string \"Fryjia is there when you open them*\\nFather...\" with actual newline. In JSON output I'd write \"Fryjia is there when you open them*\\nFather...\". Fine.\n\nAlso for Q049, target_span \"始终会显示\" — verbatim in target: \"始终会显示彩色的轨迹提示\" — yes \"始终会显示\".\n\nQ041 target_span \"法术选择\" — verbatim. Correction: \"确认陷阱选择\".\n\nQ044 correction: \"让淤泥巢穴中的 100 面墙变成敌对生物。\"\n\nQ047 correction: \"看来在你刚才和那只生物搏斗的时候被打碎了\" — better: \"看来在你刚才和携带它的生物搏斗的时候被打碎了\". claim_type REFERENT.\n\nQ050 correction: \"（你在此看到一座庞大而精致的喷泉。...\"\n\nQ051 correction: \"一枚戒指\".\n\nQ055 correction: \"击杀鲜血大师才是正确的选择\". claim_type DIRECTION (reversed action). target_span \"放走鲜血大师\".\n\nQ057 correction: \"重新加载/重新生成区域和关卡\". claim_type VALUE. target_span \"地图和角色\".\n\nQ058 correction: \"在 Lua 中查看 [抛射物]\". claim_type ADDITION (or CONDITION). target_span \"即使此处没有抛射物，也可\".\n\nQ059 correction: \"通过裂解清除敌人身上的89个增益效果\" (remove 必须单次). target_span \"必须单次\". claim_type CONDITION.\n\nQ060 correction: \"选择半身人种族并杀死自己。\" claim_type DIRECTION. target_span \"并杀死敌人\".\n\nQ049 correction: remove 始终: \"当你用右键拖动画出鼠标手势时，会显示颜色编码的轨迹。#WHITE#\". verdict UNCERTAIN, claim_type ADDITION.\n\nQ052 correction: \"它们胜利了，但是现在它们又在哪里呢？\" verdict UNCERTAIN, claim_type ADDITION.\n\nQ056 correction: \"才发现那副庞大而破旧的战甲里其实是一个人类。\" claim_type REFERENT.\n\nOrder Q041..Q060. Output JSON only.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"```json\n{\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"Q041\",\n      \"candidates\": [\n        {\n          \"verdict\": \"FINDING\",\n          \"claim_type\": \"VALUE\",\n          \"target_span\": \"法术选择\",\n          \"correction\": \"确认陷阱选择\",\n          \"evidence\": \"You cannot prepare more than %d traps.\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"observation\": \"该界面为陷阱布置选择（source_context 中出现 traps_selected、preparing trap 等证据），source 的 selections 指陷阱选择；target 误译为“法术选择”。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"Q042\",\n      \"candidates\": [],\n      \"observation\": \"“到达无尽地下城第10层。”与 “Got to level 10 of the infinite dungeon.” 含义一致，无客观缺陷。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"Q043\",\n      \"candidates\": [],\n      \"observation\": \"“这可不像我这个隐士该有的态度。”忠实传达了 “THAT'S NOT A VERY HERMIT-LIKE ATTITUDE.” 的否定含义，无客观缺陷。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"Q044\",\n      \"candidates\": [\n        {\n          \"verdict\": \"FINDING\",\n          \"claim_type\": \"VALUE\",\n          \"target_span\": \"200 面墙\",\n          \"correction\": \"让淤泥巢穴中的 100 面墙变成敌对生物。\",\n          \"evidence\": \"Have 100 walls on the sludgenest turn into hostile creatures.\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"observation\": \"source 明确为 100 面墙，target 译为 200，数值错误。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"Q045\",\n      \"candidates\": [],\n      \"observation\": \"source 为被打断的半句 “But what is all th...”，target “但是这一切到底是……”的处理与可见证据相容，无客观缺陷。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"Q046\",\n      \"candidates\": [],\n      \"observation\": \"“杀死一名厄运行者。”与 “Killed a Bringer of Doom.” 的动作与对象一致，无客观缺陷。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"Q047\",\n      \"candidates\": [\n        {\n          \"verdict\": \"FINDING\",\n          \"claim_type\": \"REFERENT\",\n          \"target_span\": \"和那个人类搏斗\",\n          \"correction\": \"看来在你刚才和携带它的那只生物搏斗的时候被打碎了。\",\n          \"evidence\": \"that spider is the matriarch here\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"observation\": \"source 仅说 “the creature carrying it”（携带纸片的生物）；source_context 明确该生物是蜘蛛（“that spider is the matriarch here”），target 改为“那个人类”，指代与可见证据相矛盾。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"Q048\",\n      \"candidates\": [],\n      \"observation\": \"“博学者哈达克的记录，第三部分”与 “Records of Lorekeeper Hadak part three” 对应准确，无客观缺陷。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"Q049\",\n      \"candidates\": [\n        {\n          \"verdict\": \"UNCERTAIN\",\n          \"claim_type\": \"ADDITION\",\n          \"target_span\": \"始终会显示\",\n          \"correction\": \"当你用右键拖动画出鼠标手势时，会显示颜色编码的轨迹。#WHITE#\",\n          \"evidence\": \"config.settings.hide_gestures = not config.settings.hide_gestures\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"observation\": \"source 只说做手势时会显示轨迹，未说“始终”显示；且该选项通过 hide_gestures 开关控制可禁用，“始终”为额外添加的条件，但开关语义存在一定解释空间，故列为 UNCERTAIN。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"Q050\",\n      \"candidates\": [\n        {\n          \"verdict\": \"FINDING\",\n          \"claim_type\": \"ADDITION\",\n          \"target_span\": \"位于德斯镇\",\n          \"correction\": \"（你在此看到一座庞大而精致的喷泉。\",\n          \"evidence\": \"Angolwen Fountain\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"observation\": \"source 未提及喷泉所在地点；source_context 中该文本的名称为 “Angolwen Fountain”（安戈尔wen 喷泉），target 添加“位于德斯镇”与可见证据相矛盾。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"Q051\",\n      \"candidates\": [\n        {\n          \"verdict\": \"FINDING\",\n          \"claim_type\": \"VALUE\",\n          \"target_span\": \"一枚项链\",\n          \"correction\": \"一枚戒指\",\n          \"evidence\": \"If you bring me a gem and a ring\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"observation\": \"source 明确要求带来 “a gem and a ring”（宝石和戒指），target 误译为“项链”，且与同句后文的“镶嵌到戒指里”自相矛盾。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"Q052\",\n      \"candidates\": [\n        {\n          \"verdict\": \"UNCERTAIN\",\n          \"claim_type\": \"ADDITION\",\n          \"target_span\": \"兽人\",\n          \"correction\": \"它们是胜利了，但是现在它们又在哪里呢？\",\n          \"evidence\": \"Those are Sher'Tuls? They fought the gods?!\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"observation\": \"source 仅用代词 “they”，指代前文谈及的 Sher'Tuls；target 明确补出主语“兽人”。可见文本中未说明 Sher'Tuls 是兽人，该主语为新增信息，证据不足以确证为错，列为 UNCERTAIN。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"Q053\",\n      \"candidates\": [],\n      \"observation\": \"钥匙、泰尔玛废墟的封印、《反转与复原概率场》文献及存活几率提升等信息在 target 中均完整、准确对应，无客观缺陷。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"Q054\",\n      \"candidates\": [],\n      \"observation\": \"“我清完‘死亡之屋’后发现我只得到了这个无聊的成就！”忠实传达了原句的自嘲语气和内容，无客观缺陷。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"Q055\",\n      \"candidates\": [\n        {\n          \"verdict\": \"FINDING\",\n          \"claim_type\": \"DIRECTION\",\n          \"target_span\": \"放走鲜血大师\",\n          \"correction\": \"击杀鲜血大师才是正确的选择\",\n          \"evidence\": \"disposed of the Blood Master\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"observation\": \"该成就（id=RING_BLOOD_KILL）的描述为 “disposed of the Blood Master”（除掉鲜血大师），target 译为“放走鲜血大师”，动作方向完全相反。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"Q056\",\n      \"candidates\": [\n        {\n          \"verdict\": \"FINDING\",\n          \"claim_type\": \"REFERENT\",\n          \"target_span\": \"弗莉吉亚的弟弟\",\n          \"correction\": \"才发现那副庞大而破旧的战甲里其实是一个人类。\",\n          \"evidence\": \"Fryjia is there when you open them*\\nFather...\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"observation\": \"source 明确说战甲里是 “a human”；source_context 中战败场景（valfren-defeat）显示 Valfren 倒下后弗莉吉亚称其为 “Father”，可见证据指向此人是弗莉吉亚的父亲，target 改为“弟弟”与证据相矛盾。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"Q057\",\n      \"candidates\": [\n        {\n          \"verdict\": \"FINDING\",\n          \"claim_type\": \"VALUE\",\n          \"target_span\": \"地图和角色\",\n          \"correction\": \"重新加载/重新生成区域和关卡\",\n          \"evidence\": \"Reload/regenerate Zone and level\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"observation\": \"source 的 “Zone and level” 指区域和关卡层级，target 误译为“角色”，对象错误（该功能对应 ReloadZone）。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"Q058\",\n      \"candidates\": [\n        {\n          \"verdict\": \"FINDING\",\n          \"claim_type\": \"ADDITION\",\n          \"target_span\": \"即使此处没有抛射物，也可\",\n          \"correction\": \"在 Lua 中查看 [抛射物]\",\n          \"evidence\": \"if p and config.settings.cheat then\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"observation\": \"source 仅为菜单项 “Lua inspect [Projectile]”；按 source_context，该菜单项仅在实际存在抛射物（p）且开启作弊时才会添加，target 添加的“即使此处没有抛射物，也可”与代码逻辑相矛盾。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"Q059\",\n      \"candidates\": [\n        {\n          \"verdict\": \"FINDING\",\n          \"claim_type\": \"CONDITION\",\n          \"target_span\": \"必须单次\",\n          \"correction\": \"通过裂解清除敌人身上的89个增益效果\",\n          \"evidence\": \"self.nb = (self.nb or 0) + 1\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"observation\": \"source_context 显示计数器为累计式（每次 +1，进度 “ / 89”），并非要求单次完成；target 添加“必须单次”与可见证据相矛盾。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"Q060\",\n      \"candidates\": [\n        {\n          \"verdict\": \"FINDING\",\n          \"claim_type\": \"DIRECTION\",\n          \"target_span\": \"并杀死敌人\",\n          \"correction\": \"选择半身人种族并杀死自己。\",\n          \"evidence\": \"Killed oneself as a halfling.\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"observation\": \"source 描述的是半身人自杀（成就 “Fool of a Took!”，id=HALFLING_SUICIDE），target 译为“杀死敌人”，动作对象完全相反。\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"zai-standard-cn","model":"glm-5.3-flash","usage":{"input":10810,"output":7947,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"reasoning":5724,"totalTokens":18757,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1787984617206,"responseId":"202608291423372cc52b1fbf404b0f","rawStopReason":"stop"}}
{"type":"turn_end","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Let me go through each item.\n\nQ041: source \"Accept these selections\" (a button label in trap selection dialog). Target \"确认法术选择\" — \"Confirm spell selection\". Issues: \"traps\" translated as \"法术\" (spells) — source context is about traps. Also \"Accept\" → \"确认\" is fine-ish, but \"selections\" of traps → \"法术选择\". FINDING: traps vs spells. Also \"Accept\" means accept these selections; target says \"确认\" which is acceptable-ish. Main defect: traps→法术. claim_type VALUE/OTHER. target_span \"法术选择\", evidence \"Accept these selections\" — the evidence for trap comes from source_context (self.traps_selected, \"Preparing trap\"). Evidence must be verbatim from source or source_context. Use \"traps_selected\" or \"Preparing trap with normal trigger.\" Better: evidence \"You cannot prepare more than %d traps.\" Use that.\n\nQ042: \"Got to level 10 of the infinite dungeon.\" Target \"到达无尽地下城第10层。\" Accurate. candidates empty.\n\nQ043: \"THAT'S NOT A VERY HERMIT-LIKE ATTITUDE.\" Target \"这可不像我这个隐士该有的态度。\" — \"my hermit attitude\" — source says \"not a very hermit-like attitude\" — target adds \"我这个\" but that's compatible (the speaker is the hermit). Not an objective defect. Empty.\n\nQ044: source \"Have 100 walls...\" target \"让淤泥巢穴中的 200 面墙...\" — 100 vs 200. FINDING. target_span \"200 面墙\", evidence \"Have 100 walls on the sludgenest turn into hostile creatures.\"\n\nQ045: \"But what is all th...\" target \"但是这一切到底是……\" The source is cut off \"what is all th...\" — target conveys. Fine. Empty.\n\nQ046: \"Killed a Bringer of Doom.\" target \"杀死一名厄运行者。\" \"a Bringer of Doom\" — 厄运行者 is a translation choice. Fine. Empty.\n\nQ047: source about \"your fight with the creature carrying it\" — creature carrying the paper. Target: \"看来在你刚才和那个人类搏斗的时候被打碎了\" — \"the human\"? Source doesn't say human; context: spiders, the matriarch spider, Sun Paladin journal. The creature carrying it — target says \"那个人类\" (that human). That's an addition/misidentification: source context indicates spiders (arachnids), not a human. Hmm, but rule 3: new info compatible with visible evidence and not refutable? The context strongly indicates the creature is a spider (the fight with the matriarch spider, journal says spiders). Target says \"人类\" (human) which contradicts context: \"that spider is the matriarch here\". So FINDING: \"creature\" → \"人类\" contradicts context. claim_type REFERENT. target_span \"和那个人类搏斗\", evidence from source_context: \"that spider is the matriarch here\". Also \"被打碎了\" — paper ruined/打碎? \"ruined from your fight\" — target says paper \"被打碎了\" (shattered) — paper being shattered vs ruined; minor. Also translation: \"对大部分埃亚尔野生生命体有效的信息素在'太阳骑士'这种物种的身上被证明无效\" — fine. \"passive study would lead to great loss\" — \"被动的研究会导致巨大的损失\" fine. \"next step of emigration program should be cleaning of local 'sun paladin' nest and establishment of...\" — \"移民计划的下一步是清理...\" fine. Also quotes: uses \"太阳骑士\" with different quote marks — style. Main finding: 人类.\n\nAlso note: \"sun paladin\" translated as \"太阳骑士\" (Sun Knight?) — conventional translation in ToME Chinese is 太阳骑士 actually (Sun Paladin = 太阳骑士). Fine.\n\nQ048: \"Records of Lorekeeper Hadak part three\" → \"博学者哈达克的记录，第三部分\". Fine. Empty.\n\nQ049: source \"When you do a mouse gesture (right click + drag) a color coded trail is displayed.\" Target: \"当你用右键拖动画出鼠标手势时，始终会显示彩色的轨迹提示。\" — adds \"始终\" (always) — is that supported? The option is \"Display mouse gesture trails\" with hide_gestures toggle; description says when you do a gesture a trail is displayed. Adding \"始终\" (always) is an addition not supported... but rule 3: new info compatible and not refutable by evidence? \"always\" — hmm. The description doesn't say always; it's describing the feature. Actually since the setting toggles display, the base description doesn't claim \"always\". Adding \"始终\" could be considered mis-stating? Hmm. Actually since the setting toggles display, the base description doesn't claim \"always\". \"始终\" implies unconditional, which is arguably contradicted by the toggle (hide_gestures disables). But within this item's text alone, is \"always display\" contradicted? The option name is \"Display mouse gesture trails\" with enabled/disabled. It's plausible the intent: when enabled, always display. Hmm, hard. Also \"color coded\" → \"彩色的\" loses \"color coded\" nuance (颜色编码的). Minor. \"轨迹提示\" adds \"提示\" (hint) — minor addition. I'd report UNCERTAIN on \"始终\" as ADDITION/CONDITION. Actually let me think: is it objective? The source says \"a color coded trail is displayed\" conditional on doing a gesture. Target adds \"always\" — that's added info about the display being always. The setting toggles hide_gestures, meaning trails can be hidden. So \"始终会显示\" contradicts the toggle. Evidence: \"config.settings.hide_gestures = not config.settings.hide_gestures\". I'd give FINDING on 始终? Risky. I'll say UNCERTAIN with CONDITION/ADDITION.\n\nQ050: Long fountain text. Check: target adds \"位于德斯镇\" — \"located in Derth town\"?? Source: \"You see here a large, elaborate fountain\" — no location mentioned. Lore name is \"Angolwen Fountain\" (source_context). Target says 德斯镇 (Derth) — contradicts \"Angolwen Fountain\". But 德斯镇 addition: is it refutable by visible evidence? The lore name \"Angolwen Fountain\" indicates it's in Angolwen, not Derth. So ADDITION contradicted by context. FINDING? The source_context shows name = \"Angolwen Fountain\". Derth is a different town. So the addition \"位于德斯镇\" is refuted. FINDING, claim_type ADDITION or REFERENT. target_span \"位于德斯镇\", evidence \"Angolwen Fountain\".\n\nAlso check rest: \"her arms outstretched to welcome all\" → \"她伸展双臂，欢迎所有人\" fine. \"an elf with a tall, elaborate staff\" fine. \"a halfling with a scepter in one hand and a fireball hovering over the other\" → \"一手握着权杖、另一手上方悬浮火球\" fine. \"in small print\" → \"细小字样\" fine. The carvings: \"ALL ARE WELCOME WHO LEARN FROM THE MISTAKES OF THE PAST\" → \"欢迎所有从过去的错误中吸取教训之人\" fine. \"LET THE ARCANE ONCE MORE BE A BOON AND NOT A BANE TO MAJ'EYAL\" → \"愿奥术再度成为马基·埃亚尔的助益，而非灾祸\" fine. \"MAY WE HAVE THE WISDOM TO ONE DAY REUNITE THE WORLD IN SAFETY AND ENLIGHTENMENT\" → fine. \"GATHER HERE IN PEACE TO DISCOVER AND PERFECT THE KNOWLEDGE OF HOW, AND WHEN, TO WEAVE THE WORLD'S FABRIC\" → \"在此和平相聚，探索并完善何时、如何编织世界织物的知识\" — order swapped (when, how → 何时、如何) but fine. \"repeating along the border\" → \"反复雕着一行\" fine-ish.\n\nQ051: source \"If you bring me a gem and a ring\" — target \"如果你给我找来一颗宝石和一枚项链\" — \"ring\" translated as \"项链\" (necklace/amulet)! That's a VALUE error. Then later \"我可以帮你把宝石的力量镶嵌到戒指里去\" uses 戒指. So 项链 is wrong — should be 戒指. FINDING. target_span \"一枚项链\", evidence \"If you bring me a gem and a ring\".\n\nAlso \"you need a quality ring to use a quality gem\" → \"你得寻找高品质的戒指来用于高品质的宝石\" fine. \"The original traits of the ring will be lost\" → fine. \"There is a small fee dependent on the level of the ring\" fine.\n\nQ052: \"But then where are they now if they won?\" → \"兽人是胜利了，但是现在他们又在哪里呢？\" Adds \"兽人\" (orcs) — source \"they\". Context: Sher'Tuls. Adding \"兽人\" — Sher'Tul are not orcs; they're a lost race. Is this refutable by visible evidence? Context talks about Sher'Tuls who fought the gods. Not stated they're orcs. Hmm, \"兽人\" adds a subject not in source. Visible evidence doesn't state they're orcs; can we judge it wrong? Sher'Tul... external knowledge says they're not orcs, but rule says don't rely on external knowledge. Within visible text: \"Those are Sher'Tuls? They fought the gods?!\" — no orc mention. The addition \"兽人\" is new info... can it be judged wrong by visible evidence? Not directly. Rule 3 says new info compatible with evidence and not judgeable-wrong isn't a defect. But adding a subject not present in source is an addition changing meaning — SUBJECT change. The source \"they\" refers to Sher'Tuls; target asserts orcs. Since evidence doesn't identify them as orcs, and it's a substantive addition... I think this qualifies as ADDITION/SUBJECT FINDING since the subject is explicitly added where source had only a pronoun. Hmm, but rule 3 protects compatible additions. Is \"orcs\" compatible? Ambiguous. I'd report UNCERTAIN with claim_type ADDITION.\n\nQ053: source: \"Return in a few days, and I'll have everything prepared.\" Target: \"几天后你回来，我肯定把一切都准备好了\" fine. \"Oh, take this.\" → \"哦，带上这个。\" fine. \"It opens the ruins of Telmur, which the men of Sholtar sealed many years ago.\" → \"它可以打开泰尔玛废墟，那是多年前肖尔塔人封印的地方。\" fine. \"return with it and your odds of surviving our portal attempt will go up drastically\" → \"请帮我带回来，这能大大提高你通过传送门时存活的几率。\" fine. \" Fear not\" fine. Empty.\n\nQ054: \"I cleared the room of death and all I got was this lousy achievement!\" Target: \"我清完“死亡之屋”后发现我只得到了这个无聊的成就！\" fine (meme reference). Empty.\n\nQ055: \"The Right thing to do\" → \"放走鲜血大师才是正确的选择\" — \"released the Blood Master\"?? Source context: id = \"RING_BLOOD_KILL\", desc \"Did the righteous thing in the ring of blood and disposed of the Blood Master.\" So achievement is for KILLING the Blood Master; target says 放走 (release/spare). FINDING, DIRECTION/ACTION. target_span \"放走鲜血大师\", evidence \"disposed of the Blood Master\".\n\nQ056: source mentions \"it's actually a human inside that hulking, worn armor\" — target: \"才发现那副庞大而破旧的战甲里其实装着弗莉吉亚的弟弟。\" — \"Fryjia's brother\"? Source says \"a human\". Context mentions Fryjia and her father (\"You will understand when you meet her father\"), and valfren-defeat: \"Father... *She stands silent*... You win\". So the armored figure is Fryjia's father, not brother. Target says 弟弟 (younger brother). Evidence: \"You will understand when you meet her father.\" and \"Father...\" Hmm — is that enough to establish the figure is the father? The chat id \"valfren-entry\" — Valfren. Fryjia's father is named Valfren presumably. The defeat text: Fryjia says \"Father...\" right after Valfren collapses. That strongly supports father, contradicting 弟弟. But strictly, does evidence prove the human is her father? The sequence: valfren-entry (armor appears), valfren-defeat (Valfren collapses, Fryjia: \"Father... You win... Prepare for your final battle\"). So Valfren = Father. The armored human = Valfren (entry scene). Target says 弟弟 — contradicted. I'd give FINDING? Or UNCERTAIN? The chain is fairly solid within visible text. I'll say FINDING, REFERENT. target_span \"弗莉吉亚的弟弟\", evidence \"Father... #LIGHT_GREEN#*She stands silent for a few seconds*#WHITE# You win\". Hmm, need verbatim evidence from source_context. The line: \"You close your eyes for a brief instant. Fryjia is there when you open them*\\nFather... #LIGHT_GREEN#*She stands silent for a few seconds*#WHITE# You win, @playerdescriptor.race@.\" Use \"Fryjia is there when you open them\" or simpler \"Father... #LIGHT_GREEN#*She stands silent for a few seconds*#WHITE# You win\". Actually simpler: \"You will understand when you meet her father.\" That's verbatim from source_context. Good — combined with \"Valfren collapses as the light returns\". I'll use evidence: \"Valfren collapses as the light returns to this world\" plus... only one evidence string. Use \"You will understand when you meet her father.\" Hmm, that alone doesn't tie the armored figure. Maybe UNCERTAIN is safer? The correction: 战甲里其实是一个人类（弗莉吉亚的父亲）。The visible context: the defeat chat \"valfren-defeat\" says \"Valfren collapses... Fryjia is there... Father... You win\" — implies Valfren is the father and the one defeated. The entry is \"valfren-entry\" describing the armor. So the human in armor = Valfren = Fryjia's father. I'll mark FINDING with evidence \"Valfren collapses as the light returns to this world\" — hmm, that doesn't mention father. Better combined isn't allowed in one string unless contiguous. The contiguous text: \"#LIGHT_GREEN#*Valfren collapses as the light returns to this world.\\n#LIGHT_GREEN#You close your eyes for a brief instant. Fryjia is there when you open them*\\nFather...\" Not contiguous due to newlines but I can include a multi-line verbatim snippet? Evidence must appear verbatim; newlines included. I could use: \"Fryjia is there when you open them*\\nFather...\" — that includes a newline as in the source_context string. The source_context contains \"Fryjia is there when you open them*\\nFather... #LIGHT_GREEN#*She stands silent\". In the JSON it's actual newline. I'll write evidence with \\n: \"Fryjia is there when you open them*\\nFather...\". That's verbatim.\n\nAlso check other parts of Q056: \"a massive battle armor with an equally massive battle axe\" → \"一副同样手持巨大战斧的巨型战甲\" — \"equally massive\" modifies the axe relative to armor; \"同样手持\" is odd but conveys. \"It wasn't there just a second ago.\" → \"一瞬之前那里还空无一物。\" fine. \"f...t...ma....ll...\" → \"弗……特……玛……尔……\" — transliteration addition, fine (interpreted as syllables). \"extreme emotions invading your very soul\" → \"极端的情绪侵入灵魂，将你彻底淹没\" fine. Also missing line? Source lines all present. OK.\n\nQ057: \"Reload/regenerate Zone and level\" → \"重新加载/重新生成地图和角色\" — \"level\" → \"角色\" (character)?? Should be 层/关卡. \"Zone and level\" — 地图和角色 wrong; 角色 = character. FINDING, VALUE. target_span \"地图和角色\", evidence \"Reload/regenerate Zone and level\".\n\nQ058: \"Lua inspect [Projectile]\" → \"即使此处没有抛射物，也可在 Lua 中查看 [抛射物]\" — addition \"即使此处没有抛射物\" (even if no projectile here). Source is just \"Lua inspect [Projectile]\". This is a substantive addition — the menu item only appears when there is a projectile (if p and config.settings.cheat). So the claim \"even if there's no projectile here\" is contradicted: the entry only appears if p exists. Evidence: \"if p and config.settings.cheat then list[#list+1] = {name=_t\\\"[[SOURCE_MATCH_1]]\\\"...\". FINDING, ADDITION/CONDITION. target_span \"即使此处没有抛射物，也可\", correction \"在 Lua 中查看 [抛射物]\". Evidence: \"if p and config.settings.cheat then\".\n\nQ059: \"Removed 89 beneficial effects from enemies via Disintegration.\" → \"必须单次使用裂解清除敌人身上的89个增益效果\" — adds \"必须单次\" (must in a single use). Source context: can_gain increments nb, track \" / 89\" — cumulative counter, not single use. So \"单次\" is wrong; it's cumulative. Evidence: \"self.nb = (self.nb or 0) + 1\" and track showing cumulative. FINDING, CONDITION/ADDITION. target_span \"必须单次\", evidence \"self.nb = (self.nb or 0) + 1\". Also \"Removed 89\" stated as achievement desc — target phrase \"必须...清除\" turns into requirement; that's a statement change but the desc is descriptive; the 单次 is the key objective defect. Also could note the descriptive→imperative but skip.\n\nQ060: \"Killed oneself as a halfling.\" → \"选择半身人种族并杀死敌人。\" — \"killed oneself\" (suicide) vs \"杀死敌人\" (kill enemies). Achievement \"Fool of a Took!\" id HALFLING_SUICIDE. FINDING, ACTION/DIRECTION. target_span \"并杀死敌人\", evidence \"Killed oneself as a halfling.\" Also \"选择半身人种族\" for \"as a halfling\" — okay. Main: suicide→kill enemy.\n\nNow Q041 more precisely: \"Accept these selections\" — in trap preparation dialog. Target \"确认法术选择\" — \"确认\" for Accept fine; \"法术\" for traps wrong. Also \"these selections\" → \"选择\" fine. FINDING: 法术 vs 陷阱. claim_type VALUE (or REFERENT). evidence: \"You cannot prepare more than %d traps.\" or \"self.traps_selected\". Use \"You cannot prepare more than %d traps.\"\n\nQ049 decision: I'll include UNCERTAIN candidate for 始终, and maybe also \"提示\" addition? That's trivial; skip. Also \"color coded\" → 彩色的: loses \"color coded\" meaning; colors code something. \"彩色的轨迹提示\" — minor. Skip or UNCERTAIN? I'll skip to keep focused; actually it is a small omission of \"coded\". Skip.\n\nQ047: Also \"creature carrying it\" — the paper; target \"在你刚才和那个人类搏斗的时候被打碎了\" — subject shifted to the paper being shattered, and creature → 人类. I'll report the 人类 one. Also maybe \"被打碎了\" — \"ruined\" → 被打碎; paper shattered — minor, skip.\n\nAlso Q047 target: \"对大部分埃亚尔野生生命体有效的信息素在'太阳骑士'这种物种的身上被证明无效\" — source: \"pheromone signals effective on much Eyalite wildlife ineffective on species 'sun paladin.'\" fine. \"next step ... should be cleaning of local 'sun paladin' nest and establishment of...\" → \"移民计划的下一步是清理本地的'太阳骑士'巢穴并建立…\" — \"establishment of...\" truncated, \"并建立…\" ok.\n\nQ043: also check \"这可不像我这个隐士该有的态度\" vs \"THAT'S NOT A VERY HERMIT-LIKE ATTITUDE.\" Fine.\n\nQ052: Let me decide. The target adds 兽人. Source: player asks \"But then where are they now if they won?\" after being told about Sher'Tuls. The NPC says \"They are gone now.\" Adding \"兽人\" as subject — visible evidence never says Sher'Tuls are orcs. Given rule 3, additions not judgeable-wrong are okay, but this one asserts a specific race identity. I'll report UNCERTAIN, ADDITION. Actually hmm — in ToME lore, Sher'Tul are not orcs; orc pride lore is separate in this file (Q048 context is orc history). But external knowledge not allowed. Within visible text, nothing contradicts or confirms. UNCERTAIN.\n\nQ050 德斯镇: evidence \"Angolwen Fountain\" — solid FINDING.\n\nNow compose JSON with 20 items Q041–Q060, each with observation.\n\nLet me write observations concisely (Chinese fine).\n\nItems with empty candidates: Q042, Q043, Q045, Q046, Q048, Q053, Q054.\n\nFINDINGS: Q041, Q044, Q047, Q050, Q051, Q055, Q057, Q058, Q059, Q060. UNCERTAIN: Q049, Q052, Q056(FINDING).\n\nQ056 verdict: I'll go FINDING.\n\nEvidence strings verbatim check:\n\nQ041 evidence: \"You cannot prepare more than %d traps.\" — present in source_context. Good.\n\nQ044 evidence: \"Have 100 walls on the sludgenest turn into hostile creatures.\" — present verbatim in source_context. Good.\n\nQ047 evidence: \"that spider is the matriarch here\" — verbatim in source_context (\"that spider is the matriarch here\"). Yes.\n\nQ050 evidence: \"Angolwen Fountain\" — verbatim. Good.\n\nQ051 evidence: \"If you bring me a gem and a ring\" — verbatim in source. Yes.\n\nQ055 evidence: \"disposed of the Blood Master\" — verbatim. Good.\n\nQ057 evidence: \"Reload/regenerate Zone and level\" — source. Good.\n\nQ058 evidence: \"if p and config.settings.cheat then list[#list+1] = {name=_t\\\"[[SOURCE_MATCH_1]]\\\"\" — verbatim? source_context: \"if p and config.settings.cheat then list[#list+1] = {name=_t\\\"[[SOURCE_MATCH_1]]\\\", action=\\\"debug-inspect\\\"...\" — In JSON the quote is escaped \\\" but the actual string contains \". I'll write: \"if p and config.settings.cheat then\" — simpler, verbatim.\n\nQ059 evidence: \"self.nb = (self.nb or 0) + 1\" — verbatim. Also could use track \"/ 89\". Use \"self.nb = (self.nb or 0) + 1\".\n\nQ060 evidence: \"Killed oneself as a halfling.\" — source verbatim.\n\nQ049 evidence: \"config.settings.hide_gestures = not config.settings.hide_gestures\" — verbatim.\n\nQ052: no evidence pinpoints orc; but evidence field required. Use source text \"But then where are they now if they won?\" and context \"Those are Sher'Tuls? They fought the gods?!\" as evidence showing subject is Sher'Tul. Use that.\n\nQ056 evidence: \"Fryjia is there when you open them*\\nFather...\" — the source_context has \"*She stands silent...\" hmm the exact: \"Fryjia is there when you open them*\\nFather... #LIGHT_GREEN#*She stands silent for a few seconds*#WHITE# You win, @playerdescriptor.race@.\" So evidence string \"Fryjia is there when you open them*\\nFather...\" with actual newline. In JSON output I'd write \"Fryjia is there when you open them*\\nFather...\". Fine.\n\nAlso for Q049, target_span \"始终会显示\" — verbatim in target: \"始终会显示彩色的轨迹提示\" — yes \"始终会显示\".\n\nQ041 target_span \"法术选择\" — verbatim. Correction: \"确认陷阱选择\".\n\nQ044 correction: \"让淤泥巢穴中的 100 面墙变成敌对生物。\"\n\nQ047 correction: \"看来在你刚才和那只生物搏斗的时候被打碎了\" — better: \"看来在你刚才和携带它的生物搏斗的时候被打碎了\". claim_type REFERENT.\n\nQ050 correction: \"（你在此看到一座庞大而精致的喷泉。...\"\n\nQ051 correction: \"一枚戒指\".\n\nQ055 correction: \"击杀鲜血大师才是正确的选择\". claim_type DIRECTION (reversed action). target_span \"放走鲜血大师\".\n\nQ057 correction: \"重新加载/重新生成区域和关卡\". claim_type VALUE. target_span \"地图和角色\".\n\nQ058 correction: \"在 Lua 中查看 [抛射物]\". claim_type ADDITION (or CONDITION). target_span \"即使此处没有抛射物，也可\".\n\nQ059 correction: \"通过裂解清除敌人身上的89个增益效果\" (remove 必须单次). target_span \"必须单次\". claim_type CONDITION.\n\nQ060 correction: \"选择半身人种族并杀死自己。\" claim_type DIRECTION. target_span \"并杀死敌人\".\n\nQ049 correction: remove 始终: \"当你用右键拖动画出鼠标手势时，会显示颜色编码的轨迹。#WHITE#\". verdict UNCERTAIN, claim_type ADDITION.\n\nQ052 correction: \"它们胜利了，但是现在它们又在哪里呢？\" verdict UNCERTAIN, claim_type ADDITION.\n\nQ056 correction: \"才发现那副庞大而破旧的战甲里其实是一个人类。\" claim_type REFERENT.\n\nOrder Q041..Q060. Output JSON only.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"```json\n{\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"Q041\",\n      \"candidates\": [\n        {\n          \"verdict\": \"FINDING\",\n          \"claim_type\": \"VALUE\",\n          \"target_span\": \"法术选择\",\n          \"correction\": \"确认陷阱选择\",\n          \"evidence\": \"You cannot prepare more than %d traps.\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"observation\": \"该界面为陷阱布置选择（source_context 中出现 traps_selected、preparing trap 等证据），source 的 selections 指陷阱选择；target 误译为“法术选择”。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"Q042\",\n      \"candidates\": [],\n      \"observation\": \"“到达无尽地下城第10层。”与 “Got to level 10 of the infinite dungeon.” 含义一致，无客观缺陷。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"Q043\",\n      \"candidates\": [],\n      \"observation\": \"“这可不像我这个隐士该有的态度。”忠实传达了 “THAT'S NOT A VERY HERMIT-LIKE ATTITUDE.” 的否定含义，无客观缺陷。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"Q044\",\n      \"candidates\": [\n        {\n          \"verdict\": \"FINDING\",\n          \"claim_type\": \"VALUE\",\n          \"target_span\": \"200 面墙\",\n          \"correction\": \"让淤泥巢穴中的 100 面墙变成敌对生物。\",\n          \"evidence\": \"Have 100 walls on the sludgenest turn into hostile creatures.\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"observation\": \"source 明确为 100 面墙，target 译为 200，数值错误。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"Q045\",\n      \"candidates\": [],\n      \"observation\": \"source 为被打断的半句 “But what is all th...”，target “但是这一切到底是……”的处理与可见证据相容，无客观缺陷。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"Q046\",\n      \"candidates\": [],\n      \"observation\": \"“杀死一名厄运行者。”与 “Killed a Bringer of Doom.” 的动作与对象一致，无客观缺陷。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"Q047\",\n      \"candidates\": [\n        {\n          \"verdict\": \"FINDING\",\n          \"claim_type\": \"REFERENT\",\n          \"target_span\": \"和那个人类搏斗\",\n          \"correction\": \"看来在你刚才和携带它的那只生物搏斗的时候被打碎了。\",\n          \"evidence\": \"that spider is the matriarch here\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"observation\": \"source 仅说 “the creature carrying it”（携带纸片的生物）；source_context 明确该生物是蜘蛛（“that spider is the matriarch here”），target 改为“那个人类”，指代与可见证据相矛盾。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"Q048\",\n      \"candidates\": [],\n      \"observation\": \"“博学者哈达克的记录，第三部分”与 “Records of Lorekeeper Hadak part three” 对应准确，无客观缺陷。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"Q049\",\n      \"candidates\": [\n        {\n          \"verdict\": \"UNCERTAIN\",\n          \"claim_type\": \"ADDITION\",\n          \"target_span\": \"始终会显示\",\n          \"correction\": \"当你用右键拖动画出鼠标手势时，会显示颜色编码的轨迹。#WHITE#\",\n          \"evidence\": \"config.settings.hide_gestures = not config.settings.hide_gestures\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"observation\": \"source 只说做手势时会显示轨迹，未说“始终”显示；且该选项通过 hide_gestures 开关控制可禁用，“始终”为额外添加的条件，但开关语义存在一定解释空间，故列为 UNCERTAIN。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"Q050\",\n      \"candidates\": [\n        {\n          \"verdict\": \"FINDING\",\n          \"claim_type\": \"ADDITION\",\n          \"target_span\": \"位于德斯镇\",\n          \"correction\": \"（你在此看到一座庞大而精致的喷泉。\",\n          \"evidence\": \"Angolwen Fountain\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"observation\": \"source 未提及喷泉所在地点；source_context 中该文本的名称为 “Angolwen Fountain”（安戈尔wen 喷泉），target 添加“位于德斯镇”与可见证据相矛盾。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"Q051\",\n      \"candidates\": [\n        {\n          \"verdict\": \"FINDING\",\n          \"claim_type\": \"VALUE\",\n          \"target_span\": \"一枚项链\",\n          \"correction\": \"一枚戒指\",\n          \"evidence\": \"If you bring me a gem and a ring\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"observation\": \"source 明确要求带来 “a gem and a ring”（宝石和戒指），target 误译为“项链”，且与同句后文的“镶嵌到戒指里”自相矛盾。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"Q052\",\n      \"candidates\": [\n        {\n          \"verdict\": \"UNCERTAIN\",\n          \"claim_type\": \"ADDITION\",\n          \"target_span\": \"兽人\",\n          \"correction\": \"它们是胜利了，但是现在它们又在哪里呢？\",\n          \"evidence\": \"Those are Sher'Tuls? They fought the gods?!\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"observation\": \"source 仅用代词 “they”，指代前文谈及的 Sher'Tuls；target 明确补出主语“兽人”。可见文本中未说明 Sher'Tuls 是兽人，该主语为新增信息，证据不足以确证为错，列为 UNCERTAIN。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"Q053\",\n      \"candidates\": [],\n      \"observation\": \"钥匙、泰尔玛废墟的封印、《反转与复原概率场》文献及存活几率提升等信息在 target 中均完整、准确对应，无客观缺陷。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"Q054\",\n      \"candidates\": [],\n      \"observation\": \"“我清完‘死亡之屋’后发现我只得到了这个无聊的成就！”忠实传达了原句的自嘲语气和内容，无客观缺陷。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"Q055\",\n      \"candidates\": [\n        {\n          \"verdict\": \"FINDING\",\n          \"claim_type\": \"DIRECTION\",\n          \"target_span\": \"放走鲜血大师\",\n          \"correction\": \"击杀鲜血大师才是正确的选择\",\n          \"evidence\": \"disposed of the Blood Master\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"observation\": \"该成就（id=RING_BLOOD_KILL）的描述为 “disposed of the Blood Master”（除掉鲜血大师），target 译为“放走鲜血大师”，动作方向完全相反。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"Q056\",\n      \"candidates\": [\n        {\n          \"verdict\": \"FINDING\",\n          \"claim_type\": \"REFERENT\",\n          \"target_span\": \"弗莉吉亚的弟弟\",\n          \"correction\": \"才发现那副庞大而破旧的战甲里其实是一个人类。\",\n          \"evidence\": \"Fryjia is there when you open them*\\nFather...\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"observation\": \"source 明确说战甲里是 “a human”；source_context 中战败场景（valfren-defeat）显示 Valfren 倒下后弗莉吉亚称其为 “Father”，可见证据指向此人是弗莉吉亚的父亲，target 改为“弟弟”与证据相矛盾。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"Q057\",\n      \"candidates\": [\n        {\n          \"verdict\": \"FINDING\",\n          \"claim_type\": \"VALUE\",\n          \"target_span\": \"地图和角色\",\n          \"correction\": \"重新加载/重新生成区域和关卡\",\n          \"evidence\": \"Reload/regenerate Zone and level\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"observation\": \"source 的 “Zone and level” 指区域和关卡层级，target 误译为“角色”，对象错误（该功能对应 ReloadZone）。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"Q058\",\n      \"candidates\": [\n        {\n          \"verdict\": \"FINDING\",\n          \"claim_type\": \"ADDITION\",\n          \"target_span\": \"即使此处没有抛射物，也可\",\n          \"correction\": \"在 Lua 中查看 [抛射物]\",\n          \"evidence\": \"if p and config.settings.cheat then\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"observation\": \"source 仅为菜单项 “Lua inspect [Projectile]”；按 source_context，该菜单项仅在实际存在抛射物（p）且开启作弊时才会添加，target 添加的“即使此处没有抛射物，也可”与代码逻辑相矛盾。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"Q059\",\n      \"candidates\": [\n        {\n          \"verdict\": \"FINDING\",\n          \"claim_type\": \"CONDITION\",\n          \"target_span\": \"必须单次\",\n          \"correction\": \"通过裂解清除敌人身上的89个增益效果\",\n          \"evidence\": \"self.nb = (self.nb or 0) + 1\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"observation\": \"source_context 显示计数器为累计式（每次 +1，进度 “ / 89”），并非要求单次完成；target 添加“必须单次”与可见证据相矛盾。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"Q060\",\n      \"candidates\": [\n        {\n          \"verdict\": \"FINDING\",\n          \"claim_type\": \"DIRECTION\",\n          \"target_span\": \"并杀死敌人\",\n          \"correction\": \"选择半身人种族并杀死自己。\",\n          \"evidence\": \"Killed oneself as a halfling.\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"observation\": \"source 描述的是半身人自杀（成就 “Fool of a Took!”，id=HALFLING_SUICIDE），target 译为“杀死敌人”，动作对象完全相反。\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"zai-standard-cn","model":"glm-5.3-flash","usage":{"input":10810,"output":7947,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"reasoning":5724,"totalTokens":18757,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1787984617206,"responseId":"202608291423372cc52b1fbf404b0f","rawStopReason":"stop"},"toolResults":[]}
{"type":"agent_end","messages":[{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"你是双语翻译审核员。逐条比较英文 source 与中文 target，判断是否存在客观、实质性的翻译缺陷。\n\n规则：\n\n1. 只报告可由本请求中可见文本直接支持的客观问题；不要依赖外部知识、仓库记忆、猜测或风格偏好。\n2. 若条目包含 source_context，可把它作为与 source 同等有效的源码证据；若没有，则只能使用 source 与 target。\n3. 新增但与可见证据相容、且无法由可见证据判错的具体信息，不构成缺陷。\n4. FINDING 表示证据足以确定存在缺陷；UNCERTAIN 仅用于证据指向问题但仍有真实歧义；没有可报告的客观问题时 candidates 为空数组。\n5. 一个条目可报告多个相互独立的候选。不要因为发现一个问题而停止检查，也不要让错误候选抵消正确候选。\n6. 每个候选的 target_span 必须逐字出现在 target 中；evidence 必须逐字出现在 source，或在该条目存在时逐字出现在 source_context 中。\n7. 保持输入顺序和 neutral_id 完全不变。严格输出符合给定 schema 的 JSON，不要输出 Markdown 或额外说明。\n\n缺陷类型：VALUE、DIRECTION、CONDITION、SUBJECT、REFERENT、TIMING、SCOPE、ACTION、STATE、ORDER、OMISSION、ADDITION、OTHER。\n\n输出 JSON Schema（逐字遵守）：\n{\n  \"$schema\": \"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"additionalProperties\": false,\n  \"required\": [\"items\"],\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"items\": {\n      \"type\": \"array\",\n      \"minItems\": 20,\n      \"maxItems\": 20,\n      \"items\": {\n        \"type\": \"object\",\n        \"additionalProperties\": false,\n        \"required\": [\"neutral_id\", \"candidates\", \"observation\"],\n        \"properties\": {\n          \"neutral_id\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"pattern\": \"^Q[0-9]{3}$\"},\n          \"candidates\": {\n            \"type\": \"array\",\n            \"maxItems\": 4,\n            \"items\": {\n              \"type\": \"object\",\n              \"additionalProperties\": false,\n              \"required\": [\"verdict\", \"claim_type\", \"target_span\", \"correction\", \"evidence\"],\n              \"properties\": {\n                \"verdict\": {\"enum\": [\"FINDING\", \"UNCERTAIN\"]},\n                \"claim_type\": {\"enum\": [\"VALUE\", \"DIRECTION\", \"CONDITION\", \"SUBJECT\", \"REFERENT\", \"TIMING\", \"SCOPE\", \"ACTION\", \"STATE\", \"ORDER\", \"OMISSION\", \"ADDITION\", \"OTHER\"]},\n                \"target_span\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"minLength\": 1},\n                \"correction\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"minLength\": 1},\n                \"evidence\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"minLength\": 1}\n              }\n            }\n          },\n          \"observation\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"minLength\": 1}\n        }\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}\n\n输入 JSON：\n{\"schema_version\":\"source-context-controlled-confirmation-request-b-v2\",\"items\":[{\"neutral_id\":\"Q041\",\"source\":\"Accept these selections\",\"target\":\"确认法术选择\",\"source_context\":\"\\t\\t\\t\\tgame.logPlayer(self.actor, \\\"#LIGHT_BLUE#Preparing trap with normal trigger.\\\")\\n\\t\\t\\tend\\n\\t\\t\\tself.traps_selected[tid] = not self.traps_selected[tid]\\n\\t\\t\\tself.num_sel = self.num_sel + (self.traps_selected[tid] and 1 or -1)\\n\\t\\t\\titem.color = self.traps_selected[tid] and colors_simple.LIGHT_GREEN or colors_simple.LIGHT_RED\\n\\t\\t\\tself:formatItem(item)\\n\\t\\t\\tself.c_list:drawItem(item)\\n\\t\\tend\\n\\tend\\nend\\n\\nfunction _M:generateList()\\n\\tlocal list = {{label=_t\\\"[[SOURCE_MATCH_1]]\\\", tier=0, color = colors_simple.GOLD,\\n\\t\\taction=function()\\n\\t\\t\\tif self.num_sel <= self.max_traps then\\n\\t\\t\\t\\tself.actor:talentDialogReturn(self.traps_selected, self.starting_traps)\\n\\t\\t\\t\\tgame:unregisterDialog(self)\\n\\t\\t\\telse\\n\\t\\t\\t\\tgame.logPlayer(self.actor, \\\"#LIGHT_BLUE#You cannot prepare more than %d traps.\\\", self.max_traps)\\n\\t\\t\\tend\\n\\t\\tend}}\\n\\tfor tid, tier in pairs(self.trap_tids) do\\n\\t\\tlocal t = self.actor:getTalentFromId(tid)\\n\\t\\tlocal canlearn, unlearnable = self.actor:canLearnTalent(t)\\n\\t\\tlist[#list+1] = {talent=t, tid=tid, tier=tier, unlearnable=unlearnable}\"},{\"neutral_id\":\"Q042\",\"source\":\"Got to level 10 of the infinite dungeon.\",\"target\":\"到达无尽地下城第10层。\",\"source_context\":\"-- MERCHANTABILITY or FITNESS FOR A PARTICULAR PURPOSE.  See the\\n-- GNU General Public License for more details.\\n--\\n-- You should have received a copy of the GNU General Public License\\n-- along with this program.  If not, see <http://www.gnu.org/licenses/>.\\n--\\n-- Nicolas Casalini \\\"DarkGod\\\"\\n-- darkgod@te4.org\\n\\nnewAchievement{\\n\\tname = \\\"Infinite x10\\\",\\n\\tshow = \\\"full\\\",\\n\\tdesc = _t[[[[SOURCE_MATCH_1]]]],\\n}\\nnewAchievement{\\n\\tname = \\\"Infinite x20\\\",\\n\\tshow = \\\"full\\\",\\n\\tdesc = _t[[Got to level 20 of the infinite dungeon.]],\\n}\\nnewAchievement{\\n\\tname = \\\"Infinite x30\\\",\\n\\tshow = \\\"full\\\",\\n\\tdesc = _t[[Got to level 30 of the infinite dungeon.]],\\n}\\nnewAchievement{\"},{\"neutral_id\":\"Q043\",\"source\":\"THAT'S NOT A VERY HERMIT-LIKE ATTITUDE.\",\"target\":\"这可不像我这个隐士该有的态度。\",\"source_context\":\"}\\n\\nnewChat{ id=\\\"proposal\\\",\\n\\ttext = _t[[STILL CAN'T HEAR YOU, BUT LISTEN UP. THE BROTHERHOOD OF ALCHEMISTS IS ACCEPTING THE FIRST NEW APPLICANT TO DEMONSTRATE, AMONG OTHER THINGS, THREE VERY COMPLICATED ELIXIRS. I WOULDN'T BOTHER TRYING TO JOIN SUCH A BUNCH OF ADDLE-BRAINED DEGENERATES, BUT IT SO HAPPENS THAT THE BROTHERHOOD OF ALCHEMISTS HOLDS THE SECRET CURE FOR THE COMMON BLOWN-OFF ASS, WHICH IT SO HAPPENS IS OF SOME INTEREST TO ME.]],\\n\\tanswers = {\\n\\t\\t{_t\\\"HOW CAN I HELP?\\\", jump=\\\"help\\\"},\\n\\t}\\n}\\n\\nnewChat{ id=\\\"help\\\",\\n\\ttext = _t[[THE BROTHERHOOD KNOWS DAMNED WELL WHAT ADVANCES IN THE FIELD OF ALCHEMY WOULD DO FOR EVERY CIVILIZATION IN EXISTENCE, BUT THEY HOARD THEIR FEW WORTHWHILE SECRETS LIKE A GREAT BROWN WYRM SITTING ON ITS PILE OF CRAP. YOU KNOW WHAT? I DON'T EVEN WANT THE ASS-CURE FOR ME. I'M GOING TO STEAL EVERY SECRET THEY'VE GOT, WRITE THEM DOWN, MAKE A HUNDRED COPIES, AND NAIL ONE TO A TREE IN EVERY VILLAGE IN MAJ'EYAL.]],\\n\\tanswers = {\\n\\t\\t{_t\\\"[[SOURCE_MATCH_1]]\\\", jump=\\\"competition\\\"},\\n\\t}\\n}\\n\\nnewChat{ id=\\\"competition\\\",\\n\\ttext = _t[[AND THEN WHAT WILL THEY DO? ONCE THEIR PRECIOUS SECRETS-- WHICH, IN ALL PROBABILITY, EITHER DON'T EXIST OR ARE THINGS LIKE RECIPES FOR ELIXIRS OF WHO-GIVES-A-FLYING-DUCK-- ARE OUT IN THE OPEN, THE BROTHERHOOD OF ASSWIPES WILL HAVE NOTHING TO HOLD IT TOGETHER BUT ELIXIRS OF THEIR TEARS AND WIDESPREAD DISDAIN FROM THE REST OF THE WORLD. SPEAK UP, THEN. ARE YOU IN OR OUT?]],\\n\\tanswers = {\\n\\t\\t{_t\\\"I'M IN.\\\", jump=\\\"choice\\\", action = function(npc, player) player:grantQuest(\\\"brotherhood-of-alchemists\\\") end,},\\n\\t\\t{_t\\\"I CANNOT AID YOU AT THIS TIME.\\\"},\\n\\t}\\n}\\n\\nnewChat{ id=\\\"choice\\\",\"},{\"neutral_id\":\"Q044\",\"source\":\"Have 100 walls on the sludgenest turn into hostile creatures.\",\"target\":\"让淤泥巢穴中的 200 面墙变成敌对生物。\",\"source_context\":\"\\tdesc = _t[[Killed a Bringer of Doom.]],\\n}\\n\\nnewAchievement{\\n\\tname = \\\"A living one!\\\", id = \\\"CALDIZAR\\\",\\n\\tshow = \\\"name\\\", huge=true,\\n\\tdesc = _t[[Was teleported into Caldizar's Fortress, far into the void between the stars.]],\\n}\\n\\nnewAchievement{\\n\\tname = \\\"Slimefest\\\", id = \\\"SLUDGENEST100\\\",\\n\\tshow = \\\"full\\\",\\n\\tdesc = _t[[[[SOURCE_MATCH_1]]]],\\n}\\n\\nnewAchievement{\\n\\tname = \\\"Slime killer party\\\", id = \\\"SLUDGENEST200\\\",\\n\\tshow = \\\"full\\\", huge=true,\\n\\tdesc = _t[[Have 200 walls on the sludgenest turn into hostile creatures.]],\\n}\\n\\nnewAchievement{\\n\\tname = \\\"Mad slime dash\\\", id = \\\"SLUDGENEST300\\\",\\n\\tshow = \\\"full\\\", huge=true,\\n\\tdesc = _t[[Have 300 walls on the sludgenest turn into hostile creatures.]],\"},{\"neutral_id\":\"Q045\",\"source\":\"But what is all th...\",\"target\":\"但是这一切到底是……\",\"source_context\":\"-- along with this program.  If not, see <http://www.gnu.org/licenses/>.\\n--\\n-- Nicolas Casalini \\\"DarkGod\\\"\\n-- darkgod@te4.org\\n\\nnewChat{ id=\\\"welcome\\\",\\n\\ttext = _t[[#LIGHT_GREEN#*A tall man, glowing like a star, appears out of nowhere.*#WHITE#\\nOh no, another *adventurer*! You should not mess with things beyond your comprehension!\\nDo not meddle in the affairs of Time, for it passes swiftly and is easily disrupted!\\n#LIGHT_GREEN#*He looks at you more closely.*#WHITE#\\nYou seem capable. Help me, fight the abominations while I repair the timeline. It is your only way out!]],\\n\\tanswers = {\\n\\t\\t{_t\\\"[[SOURCE_MATCH_1]]\\\", action = function(npc, player) game:changeLevel(2) game.player:grantQuest(\\\"temporal-rift\\\") end},\\n\\t}\\n}\\n\\nreturn \\\"welcome\\\"\\n\"},{\"neutral_id\":\"Q046\",\"source\":\"Killed a Bringer of Doom.\",\"target\":\"杀死一名厄运行者。\",\"source_context\":\"\\tdesc = _t[[Killed the terrible Rat Lich.]],\\n}\\n\\nnewAchievement{\\n\\tname = \\\"Shasshhiy'Kaish\\\", id = \\\"EVENT_CULTISTS\\\",\\n\\tshow = \\\"name\\\",\\n\\tdesc = _t[[Killed Shasshhiy'Kaish after letting her grow as powerful as possible.]],\\n}\\n\\nnewAchievement{\\n\\tname = \\\"Bringer of Doom\\\", id = \\\"EVENT_PEDESTALS\\\",\\n\\tshow = \\\"name\\\",\\n\\tdesc = _t[[[[SOURCE_MATCH_1]]]],\\n}\\n\\nnewAchievement{\\n\\tname = \\\"A living one!\\\", id = \\\"CALDIZAR\\\",\\n\\tshow = \\\"name\\\", huge=true,\\n\\tdesc = _t[[Was teleported into Caldizar's Fortress, far into the void between the stars.]],\\n}\\n\\nnewAchievement{\\n\\tname = \\\"Slimefest\\\", id = \\\"SLUDGENEST100\\\",\\n\\tshow = \\\"full\\\",\\n\\tdesc = _t[[Have 100 walls on the sludgenest turn into hostile creatures.]],\"},{\"neutral_id\":\"Q047\",\"source\":\"#{italic}#A few tattered scraps of paper lie on the ground, ruined from your fight with the creature carrying it.  It's almost completely illegible, but you can piece some of it together to read:#{normal}#\\n\\\"...pheromone signals effective on much Eyalite wildlife ineffective on species 'sun paladin.'  at current planetary core cooling rates, passive study would lead to great loss - next step of emigration program should be cleaning of local 'sun paladin' nest and establishment of...\\\"\",\"target\":\"#{italic}#地上有一些破烂的纸片，看来在你刚才和那个人类搏斗的时候被打碎了。纸片上的文字几乎完全无法辨认，你只能依稀拼凑出一些文字：#{normal}#\\n“…对大部分埃亚尔野生生命体有效的信息素在‘太阳骑士’这种物种的身上被证明无效。在当前的行星核心冷却速率下，被动的研究会导致巨大的损失——移民计划的下一步是清理本地的“太阳骑士”巢穴并建立…”\",\"source_context\":\"\\nI have slain dozens of these arachnids, each one seemingly more difficult than the last. I am unsure if this is a result of my weariness, or if they are also adapting to my movements and battle techniques. I don't see how that could be possible however, a mere spider couldn't possibly adapt to the battle techniques of a veteran Sun Paladin, it's simply not feasible. Furthermore, the origin of these spiders worries me. So far I have not found any other entrances to this cavern, meaning they were transported here via other means. Those arcane rifts I found earlier are starting to worry me, and I fear for us all when I think of what may be waiting for us beyond them. I must put these thoughts out of my mind; distractions will only serve to weaken my resolve.\\n\\n#{bold}#Journal Entry VIII#{normal}#\\n\\nIncredible, the size of that arachnid is unimaginable; there is no doubt about it, that spider is the matriarch here. I am heavily wounded, but there is no turning back now; I must finish what I started for the sake of all those awaiting my return. If I don't make it back, whoever is now reading this journal, please make High Sun Paladin Aeryn at the Gates of Morning aware of the grave situation... and tell Melnela that I'm sorry.]]\\n}\\n\\nnewLore{\\n\\tid = \\\"ardhungol-4\\\",\\n\\tcategory = \\\"ardhungol\\\",\\n\\tname = _t\\\"scrap of paper\\\",\\n\\tlore = function() return game and game.state and game.state.spydre_mantra and _t[[[[SOURCE_MATCH_1]]]]\\n\\tor\\n\\t_t[[#{italic}#This pile of tattered paper could theoretically be assembled into something legible, but without more text to draw back on, it'd still be in a language you could never interpret.  If only you had more Spydric text to help translate this...#{normal}#]]\\n\\tend,\\n}\\n\"},{\"neutral_id\":\"Q048\",\"source\":\"Records of Lorekeeper Hadak part three\",\"target\":\"博学者哈达克的记录，第三部分\",\"source_context\":\"\\tname = _t\\\"Records of Lorekeeper Hadak part two\\\",\\n\\tlore = _t[[After fighting back the other races we began to build and prosper. Finally we had our own towns and cities, and we began to advance our own abilities. Though battles were still ongoing at our borders we were free to thrive and prosper.\\n\\nBut then the accursed Shaloren mages began experimenting with Sher'Tul ruins. Oh what a dark and terrible a day it was for our race! The Spellblaze massacred our people. Earthquakes tore up our new-built towns, fires raged over old and young alike, and the whole world was turned to turmoil. Afterwards disease and blight ravaged our people, utterly ruining all the progress we had made.\\n\\nOnly the strongest of us lived through the dark times that followed. We fled east, back to our dark and hidden places, but our people swore terrible oaths of vengeance on the races that had brought such bloody ruin upon us.]],\\n\\ton_learn = function(who) world:gainAchievement(\\\"ORC_LORE\\\") end,\\n}\\n\\nnewLore{\\n\\tid = \\\"orc-history-3\\\",\\n\\tcategory = \\\"orc prides\\\",\\n\\tname = _t\\\"[[SOURCE_MATCH_1]]\\\",\\n\\tlore = _t[[During the Age of Dusk we lay hidden, nursing our wounds and plotting our revenge. But this turned against us, as centuries after the Spellblaze had torn our race apart, the Cataclysm would bring ruin upon us again. We were finally recovering our numbers when earthquakes tore through all of our settlements. Falling rocks crushed and smothered us, thousands of us were left trapped to die beneath the ground. What few of us were left came out to a changed world.\\n\\nThe effects of magic left a grave impression on us then, and we knew we must learn its secrets in order to compete. For centuries we studied the effects of the Spellblaze, and captured enemy mages to experiment on them. Finally we were able to master the arts of magic and use them for ourselves. We built up our capabilities in secret, waiting for the right moment to strike a decisive vengeance. Garkul the Devourer, the greatest of our race, brought the plans to fruition. Under his awe-inspiring leadership we marched out upon the halfling kingdoms and burnt all before us. What glorious retribution we had! Whole cities were felled beneath our wrath. Everywhere we went we piled the bodies of our victims high and lit them in blazing pyres, as a symbol of our indomitable strength.\\n\\nThe Age of Pyre was our age, the time when we showed ourselves the strongest of the races, standing alone and unbeatable.]],\\n\\ton_learn = function(who) world:gainAchievement(\\\"ORC_LORE\\\") end,\\n}\\n\\nnewLore{\\n\\tid = \\\"orc-history-4\\\",\\n\\tcategory = \\\"orc prides\\\",\\n\\tname = _t\\\"Records of Lorekeeper Hadak part four\\\",\"},{\"neutral_id\":\"Q049\",\"source\":\"When you do a mouse gesture (right click + drag) a color coded trail is displayed.#WHITE#\",\"target\":\"当你用右键拖动画出鼠标手势时，始终会显示彩色的轨迹提示。#WHITE#\",\"source_context\":\"\\t\\tself.c_list:drawItem(item)\\n\\tend,}\\n\\n\\tlocal zone = Textzone.new{width=self.c_desc.w, height=self.c_desc.h, text=(_t\\\"Always display combat properties of shields even if you don't know shield attack talents.#WHITE#\\\"):toTString()}\\n\\tlist[#list+1] = { zone=zone, name=(_t\\\"#GOLD##{bold}#Always show shield combat properties#WHITE##{normal}#\\\"):toTString(), status=function(item)\\n\\t\\treturn tostring(config.settings.tome.display_shield_stats and _t\\\"enabled\\\" or _t\\\"disabled\\\")\\n\\tend, fct=function(item)\\n\\t\\tconfig.settings.tome.display_shield_stats = not config.settings.tome.display_shield_stats\\n\\t\\tgame:saveSettings(\\\"tome.display_shield_stats\\\", (\\\"tome.display_shield_stats = %s\\\\n\\\"):format(tostring(config.settings.tome.display_shield_stats)))\\n\\t\\tself.c_list:drawItem(item)\\n\\tend,}\\n\\n\\tlocal zone = Textzone.new{width=self.c_desc.w, height=self.c_desc.h, text=(_t\\\"[[SOURCE_MATCH_1]]\\\"):toTString()}\\n\\tlist[#list+1] = { zone=zone, name=(_t\\\"#GOLD##{bold}#Display mouse gesture trails#WHITE##{normal}#\\\"):toTString(), status=function(item)\\n\\t\\treturn tostring(config.settings.hide_gestures and _t\\\"disabled\\\" or _t\\\"enabled\\\")\\n\\tend, fct=function(item)\\n\\t\\tconfig.settings.hide_gestures = not config.settings.hide_gestures\\n\\t\\tgame:saveSettings(\\\"hide_gestures\\\", (\\\"hide_gestures = %s\\\\n\\\"):format(tostring(config.settings.hide_gestures)))\\n\\t\\tself.c_list:drawItem(item)\\n\\tend,}\\n\\n\\tlocal zone = Textzone.new{width=self.c_desc.w, height=self.c_desc.h, text=(_t\\\"If enabled new quests and quests updates will display a big popup, if not a simple line of text will fly on the screen.#WHITE#\\\"):toTString()}\\n\\tlist[#list+1] = { zone=zone, name=(_t\\\"#GOLD##{bold}#Big Quest Popups#WHITE##{normal}#\\\"):toTString(), status=function(item)\\n\\t\\treturn tostring(config.settings.tome.quest_popup and _t\\\"enabled\\\" or _t\\\"disabled\\\")\\n\\tend, fct=function(item)\"},{\"neutral_id\":\"Q050\",\"source\":\"#{italic}#(You see here a large, elaborate fountain.  A statue of Linaniil stands in the center, her arms outstretched to welcome all; around the outside of the fountain stand statues of a dwarf manipulating earthen runes, a human with a simple healer's crosier, an elf with a tall, elaborate staff, and a halfling with a scepter in one hand and a fireball hovering over the other.  The runes and the fireball are not connected to anything, and float in a fixed position in the air.  You see a carving repeating along the border of the fountain, in small print.)#{normal}#\\n\\nALL ARE WELCOME WHO LEARN FROM THE MISTAKES OF THE PAST\\n\\nLET THE ARCANE ONCE MORE BE A BOON AND NOT A BANE TO MAJ'EYAL\\n\\nALL ARE WELCOME WHO EASE THE SUFFERING OF THE PRESENT\\n\\nMAY WE HAVE THE WISDOM TO ONE DAY REUNITE THE WORLD IN SAFETY AND ENLIGHTENMENT\\n\\nALL ARE WELCOME WHO PREVENT THE THREATS OF THE FUTURE\\n\\nGATHER HERE IN PEACE TO DISCOVER AND PERFECT THE KNOWLEDGE OF HOW, AND WHEN, TO WEAVE THE WORLD'S FABRIC\",\"target\":\"#{italic}#（你在此看到一座位于德斯镇、庞大而精致的喷泉。莱娜尼尔的雕像站在中央，她伸展双臂，欢迎所有人；喷泉外缘周围站着几座雕像：一名操纵大地符文的矮人，一名持简朴治疗师权杖的人类，一名持高大精巧法杖的精灵，以及一名一手握着权杖、另一手上方悬浮火球的半身人。那些符文与火球未与任何东西相连，却保持在空中的固定位置。你看见喷泉边缘反复雕着一行细小字样。）#{normal}#\\n\\n欢迎所有从过去的错误中吸取教训之人\\n\\n愿奥术再度成为马基·埃亚尔的助益，而非灾祸\\n\\n欢迎所有缓解当下苦难之人\\n\\n愿我们拥有智慧，终有一日在安全与启蒙中使世界重新团结\\n\\n欢迎所有阻止未来威胁之人\\n\\n在此和平相聚，探索并完善何时、如何编织世界织物的知识\",\"source_context\":\"Another day dawns on Angolwen. I hesitate to write this, but it almost feels as if peace is once again returning to Eyal. Saying this, I almost expect war and destruction to erupt immediately - fate is anything if not spiteful. Regardless, my sleep grows less disturbed by my memories of the Spellhunt day by day, and I can now devote myself wholly to the betterment of our cloistered community here in the mountains.\\n\\nThis is not to say that life has been without conflict at all. An agent of the Ziguranth infiltrated Angolwen under the guise of a travelling alchemist a few days ago; an unhappy first, I'm afraid. Having used choking powder to incapacitate the guards and rob the surrounding mages of their voices, things may have turned ugly if Linaniil hadn't been passing by on one of her walks. Little was left of that man... or the tree he hid behind... or many of the surrounding buildings, to be honest.\\n\\nIn a way, the incident lit a fire under me to pursue my studies and develop my powers, but I must admit that my interest in staff practice has waned as of late. My fencing, on the other hand, improves by the day. Hmm... I wonder if I can get some of the enchanters to help me \\\"augment\\\" my old sword. After all, what is a blade but a sharpened metal staff?]],\\n}\\n\\nnewLore{\\n\\tid = \\\"angolwen-fountain\\\",\\n\\tcategory = \\\"angolwen\\\",\\n\\tname = _t\\\"Angolwen Fountain\\\",\\n\\talways_pop = true,\\n\\tlore = _t[[[[SOURCE_MATCH_1]]]],\\n}\\n\"},{\"neutral_id\":\"Q051\",\"source\":\"Then you are at the right place, for I am an expert jeweler.\\nIf you bring me a gem and a ring, I can create a new ring imbued with the properties of the gem.  The original traits of the ring will be lost in the process but new ones of similar quality will be generated.\\nThere is a small fee dependent on the level of the ring, and you need a quality ring to use a quality gem.\",\"target\":\"你算找对地方了，我可是一个珠宝专家。\\n如果你给我找来一颗宝石和一枚项链，我可以帮你把宝石的力量镶嵌到戒指里去。这颗戒指里面原来所有的属性会丢失掉，不过也会生成一些质量相似的新属性。\\n不过根据戒指等级我要收取一小笔费用。你得寻找高品质的戒指来用于高品质的宝石。\",\"source_context\":\"\\t\\t{_t\\\"Let me see your wares.\\\", action=function(npc, player)\\n\\t\\t\\tnpc.store:loadup(game.level, game.zone)\\n\\t\\t\\tnpc.store:interact(player)\\n\\t\\tend, cond=function(npc, player) return npc.store and true or false end},\\n\\t\\t{_t\\\"I am looking for special jewelry.\\\", jump=\\\"jewelry\\\"},\\n\\t\\t{_t\\\"So you can infuse amulets in this place?\\\", jump=\\\"artifact_jewelry\\\", cond=function(npc, player) return npc.can_craft and player:hasQuest(\\\"master-jeweler\\\") and player:isQuestStatus(\\\"master-jeweler\\\", engine.Quest.COMPLETED, \\\"limmir-survived\\\") end},\\n\\t\\t{_t\\\"I have found this tome; it looked important.\\\", jump=\\\"quest\\\", cond=function(npc, player) return npc.can_quest and player:hasQuest(\\\"master-jeweler\\\") and player:hasQuest(\\\"master-jeweler\\\"):has_tome(player) end},\\n\\t\\t{_t\\\"Sorry I have to go!\\\"},\\n\\t}\\n}\\n\\nnewChat{ id=\\\"jewelry\\\",\\n\\ttext = _t[[[[SOURCE_MATCH_1]]]],\\n\\tanswers = {\\n\\t\\t{_t\\\"I need your services.\\\", action=imbue_ring},\\n\\t\\t{_t\\\"Not now, thanks.\\\"},\\n\\t}\\n}\\n\\nnewChat{ id=\\\"artifact_jewelry\\\",\\n\\ttext = _t[[Yes! Thanks to you this place is now free from the corruption. I will stay on this island to study the magical aura, and as promised I can make you powerful amulets.\\nBring me a an amulet and two different gems and I will turn them into a powerful amulet, though the original properties of the amulet will be lost.\\nI will not make you pay a fee for it since you helped me so much, but I am afraid the ritual requires a gold plating. This should be equal to about 1000 gold pieces.]],\\n\\tanswers = {\\n\\t\\t{_t\\\"I need your services.\\\", action=artifact_imbue_amulet},\"},{\"neutral_id\":\"Q052\",\"source\":\"But then where are they now if they won?\",\"target\":\"兽人是胜利了，但是现在他们又在哪里呢？\",\"source_context\":\"\\nYou shake your head as the vision dissipates, and your normal sight comes back slowly.\\n#WHITE#*\\n]],\\n\\tanswers = {\\n\\t\\t{_t\\\"Those are Sher'Tuls? They fought the gods?!\\\", jump=\\\"godslayers\\\"},\\n\\t}\\n}\\n\\nnewChat{ id=\\\"godslayers\\\",\\n\\ttext = _t[[They had to. They forged terrible weapons of war. They won.]],\\n\\tanswers = {\\n\\t\\t{_t\\\"[[SOURCE_MATCH_1]]\\\", jump=\\\"where\\\"},\\n\\t}\\n}\\n\\nnewChat{ id=\\\"where\\\",\\n\\ttext = _t[[They are gone now. I cannot tell you more.]],\\n\\tanswers = {\\n\\t\\t{_t\\\"But I am the master!\\\", jump=\\\"where\\\"},\\n\\t\\t{_t\\\"Fine.\\\", jump=\\\"welcome\\\"},\\n\\t}\\n}\\n\\nnewChat{ id=\\\"storage\\\",\"},{\"neutral_id\":\"Q053\",\"source\":\"Fear not. Return in a few days, and I'll have everything prepared. Oh, take this. #LIGHT_GREEN#*He hands you a key*#WHITE# It opens the ruins of Telmur, which the men of Sholtar sealed many years ago. If you happen to find a text in the ruins entitled \\\"Inverted and Reverted Probabilistic Fields\\\", return with it and your odds of surviving our portal attempt will go up drastically.\",\"target\":\"别害怕，几天后你回来，我肯定把一切都准备好了。哦，带上这个。 #LIGHT_GREEN#*他交给你一把钥匙。*#WHITE#它可以打开泰尔玛废墟，那是多年前肖尔塔人封印的地方。要是你在废墟之中找到一份标题是《反转与复原概率场》的文献，请帮我带回来，这能大大提高你通过传送门时存活的几率。\",\"source_context\":\"\\t\\t{_t\\\"[Wait]\\\", jump=\\\"no_orb_loan3\\\"},\\n\\t}\\n}\\n\\nnewChat{ id=\\\"no_orb_loan3\\\",\\n\\ttext = _t[[#LIGHT_GREEN#*He stops pacing and returns the Orb to you.*#WHITE# I believe I know most of what I need to. But I need a few details cleared up. You'll have to return to this Elven Chronomancer and ask him whether he meant an inverted probabilistic field or a reverted probabilistic field. I dare not guess, as the result could be quite unpleasant for you.]],\\n\\tanswers = {\\n\\t\\t{_t\\\"I'll return with the answer.\\\", action=function(npc, player) player:hasQuest(\\\"east-portal\\\"):ask_east(player) end},\\n\\t}\\n}\\n\\nnewChat{ id=\\\"orb_loan\\\",\\n\\ttext = _t[[[[SOURCE_MATCH_1]]]],\\n\\tanswers = {\\n\\t\\t{_t\\\"Thank you, and farewell.\\\", action=function(npc, player) player:hasQuest(\\\"east-portal\\\"):open_telmur(player) end},\\n\\t}\\n}\\n\\n---------------------------------------------------------------\\n-- Back to the treacherous bastard\\n---------------------------------------------------------------\\nnewChat{ id=\\\"fake_orb_end\\\",\\n\\ttext = _t[[I think not, fool. Look down.\\n#LIGHT_GREEN#*You notice you're standing on an etched portal.*#WHITE#]],\\n\\tanswers = {\"},{\"neutral_id\":\"Q054\",\"source\":\"I cleared the room of death and all I got was this lousy achievement!\",\"target\":\"我清完“死亡之屋”后发现我只得到了这个无聊的成就！\",\"source_context\":\"\\ttrack = function(self) return tstring{tostring(self.nb or 0),\\\" / 20\\\"} end,\\n}\\n\\nnewAchievement{\\n\\tname = \\\"Are you out of your mind?!\\\", id = \\\"UBER_WYRMS_OPEN\\\",\\n\\timage = \\\"npc/dragon_multihued_multi_hued_drake.png\\\",\\n\\tshow = \\\"name\\\", huge=true,\\n\\tdesc = _t[[Caught the attention of overpowered greater multi-hued wyrms in Vor Armoury. Perhaps fleeing is in order.]],\\n\\tmode = \\\"player\\\",\\n}\\n\\nnewAchievement{\\n\\tname = \\\"[[SOURCE_MATCH_1]]\\\", id = \\\"UBER_WYRMS\\\",\\n\\timage = \\\"npc/dragon_multihued_multi_hued_drake.png\\\",\\n\\tshow = \\\"name\\\", huge=true,\\n\\tdesc = _t[[Killed the seven overpowered wyrms in the \\\"Room of Death\\\" in Vor Armoury.]],\\n\\tmode = \\\"player\\\",\\n\\tcan_gain = function(self, who)\\n\\t\\tself.nb = (self.nb or 0) + 1\\n\\t\\tif self.nb >= 7 then return true end\\n\\tend,\\n}\\n\\nnewAchievement{\\n\\tname = \\\"I'm a cool hero\\\", id = \\\"NO_DERTH_DEATH\\\",\"},{\"neutral_id\":\"Q055\",\"source\":\"The Right thing to do\",\"target\":\"放走鲜血大师才是正确的选择\",\"source_context\":\"\\tdesc = _t[[Killed the weaver queen and the temporal defiler.]],\\n}\\nnewAchievement{\\n\\tname = \\\"Matrix style!\\\", id = \\\"ABASHED_EXPANSE_NO_BLAST\\\",\\n\\tshow = \\\"full\\\", huge=true,\\n\\tdesc = _t[[Finished the whole Abashed Expanse zone without being hit by a single void blast or manaworm. Dodging's fun!]],\\n\\tcan_gain = function(self, who, zone)\\n\\t\\tif not who:isQuestStatus(\\\"start-archmage\\\", engine.Quest.DONE) then return false end\\n\\t\\tif zone.void_blast_hits and zone.void_blast_hits == 0 then return true end\\n\\tend,\\n}\\nnewAchievement{\\n\\tname = \\\"[[SOURCE_MATCH_1]]\\\", id = \\\"RING_BLOOD_KILL\\\",\\n\\tshow = \\\"name\\\",\\n\\tdesc = _t[[Did the righteous thing in the ring of blood and disposed of the Blood Master.]],\\n}\\nnewAchievement{\\n\\tname = \\\"Thralless\\\", id = \\\"RING_BLOOD_FREED\\\",\\n\\tshow = \\\"full\\\",\\n\\tmode = \\\"player\\\",\\n\\tdesc = _t[[Freed at least 30 enthralled slaves in the slavers' compound.]],\\n\\tcan_gain = function(self)\\n\\t\\tself.nb = (self.nb or 0) + 1\\n\\t\\tif self.nb >= 30 then return true end\\n\\tend,\"},{\"neutral_id\":\"Q056\",\"source\":\"#LIGHT_GREEN#*You suddenly realize everything has turned dark.\\n#LIGHT_GREEN#You look around searching for your rival. And then you notice it. Standing\\n#LIGHT_GREEN#right before you, a massive battle armor with an equally massive battle axe.\\n#LIGHT_GREEN#It wasn't there just a second ago. You step back and examine him better,\\n#LIGHT_GREEN#realizing it's actually a human inside that hulking, worn armor. You can't see\\n#LIGHT_GREEN#his eyes, but you know he's piercing your soul with his stare*\\nf...t...ma....ll...\\n#LIGHT_GREEN#*You hear a devilish voice, coming from everywhere at once!! But...you are\\n#LIGHT_GREEN#unable to understand anything! It doesn't seem like any language used in\\n#LIGHT_GREEN#Maj'Eyal!\\n#LIGHT_GREEN#And then...a piercing, demonic roar...you are overwhelmed by extreme\\n#LIGHT_GREEN#emotions invading your very soul!!*\\n\",\"target\":\"#LIGHT_GREEN#*你突然发现四周陷入了黑暗。\\n#LIGHT_GREEN#你环顾四周，寻找自己的对手。随即，你注意到了它：\\n#LIGHT_GREEN#一副同样手持巨大战斧的巨型战甲，就站在你面前。\\n#LIGHT_GREEN#一瞬之前那里还空无一物。你后退一步，仔细端详，\\n#LIGHT_GREEN#才发现那副庞大而破旧的战甲里其实装着弗莉吉亚的弟弟。\\n#LIGHT_GREEN#你看不见他的双眼，却知道他的目光正刺穿你的灵魂*\\n弗……特……玛……尔……\\n#LIGHT_GREEN#*一个魔鬼般的声音突然从四面八方同时传来！！但……\\n#LIGHT_GREEN#你完全听不懂！这不像\\n#LIGHT_GREEN#马基·埃亚尔使用的任何一种语言！\\n#LIGHT_GREEN#紧接着……一声刺耳的恶魔咆哮……\\n#LIGHT_GREEN#极端的情绪侵入灵魂，将你彻底淹没！！*\\n\",\"source_context\":\"#LIGHT_GREEN#*She bows politely*\\nFryjia was right about you: you seem to be a champion in the works!\\nOh, and please forgive her behavior. You will understand when you meet her father.\\nAnd, if you keep fighting like this, it will be really soon.\\nSo, it's been my pleasure, @playername@. #LIGHT_GREEN#*She vanishes in a spiral of flame*]],\\n\\tanswers = {\\n\\t\\t{_t\\\"I am pumped up! What's next?\\\", action=entershop},\\n\\t\\t{_t\\\"Am I the only person with a name that can die here?\\\", action=entershop}\\n\\t}\\n}\\n\\nnewChat{ id=\\\"valfren-entry\\\",\\ntext = _t[[[[SOURCE_MATCH_1]]]],\\n\\tanswers = {\\n\\t\\t{_t\\\"#LIGHT_GREEN#*You valiantly stand against the darkness*\\\"},\\n\\t}\\n}\\n\\nnewChat{ id=\\\"valfren-defeat\\\",\\ntext = _t[[#LIGHT_GREEN#*You valiantly deliver the finishing blow!*\\n#LIGHT_GREEN#*Valfren collapses as the light returns to this world.\\n#LIGHT_GREEN#You close your eyes for a brief instant. Fryjia is there when you open them*\\nFather... #LIGHT_GREEN#*She stands silent for a few seconds*#WHITE# You win, @playerdescriptor.race@.\\nYou have done well. Prepare for your final battle... if you win, we will be at your service.\"},{\"neutral_id\":\"Q057\",\"source\":\"Reload/regenerate Zone and level\",\"target\":\"重新加载/重新生成地图和角色\",\"source_context\":\"\\tlist[#list+1] = {name=_t\\\"Alter Faction\\\", dialog=\\\"AlterFaction\\\"}\\n\\tlist[#list+1] = {name=_t\\\"Summon a Creature\\\", dialog=\\\"SummonCreature\\\"}\\n\\tlist[#list+1] = {name=_t\\\"Create Items\\\", dialog=\\\"CreateItem\\\"}\\n\\tlist[#list+1] = {name=_t\\\"Create a Trap\\\", dialog=\\\"CreateTrap\\\"}\\n\\tlist[#list+1] = {name=_t\\\"Grant/Alter Quests\\\", dialog=\\\"GrantQuest\\\"}\\n\\tlist[#list+1] = {name=_t\\\"Advance Player\\\", dialog=\\\"AdvanceActor\\\"}\\n\\tlist[#list+1] = {name=_t\\\"Remove or Kill all creatures\\\", action=\\\"remove-all\\\"}\\n\\tlist[#list+1] = {name=_t\\\"Give Sher'tul fortress energy\\\", action=\\\"shertul-energy\\\"}\\n\\tlist[#list+1] = {name=_t\\\"Give all ingredients\\\", action=\\\"all-ingredients\\\"}\\n\\tlist[#list+1] = {name=_t\\\"Weakdamage\\\", action=\\\"weakdamage\\\"}\\n\\tlist[#list+1] = {name=_t\\\"Spawn Event\\\", dialog=\\\"SpawnEvent\\\"}\\n\\tlist[#list+1] = {name=_t\\\"Endgamify\\\", class=\\\"Endgamify\\\"}\\n\\tlist[#list+1] = {name=_t\\\"[[SOURCE_MATCH_1]]\\\", class=\\\"ReloadZone\\\"}\\n\\tlist[#list+1] = {name=_t\\\"Automatically Clear Zones\\\", class=\\\"AdvanceZones\\\"}\\n\\tself:triggerHook{\\\"DebugMain:generate\\\", menu=list}\\n\\n\\tlocal chars = {}\\n\\tfor i, v in ipairs(list) do\\n\\t\\tv.name = self:makeKeyChar(i)..\\\") \\\"..v.name\\n\\t\\tchars[self:makeKeyChar(i)] = i\\n\\tend\\n\\tlist.chars = chars\\n\\n\\tself.list = list\\nend\"},{\"neutral_id\":\"Q058\",\"source\":\"Lua inspect [Projectile]\",\"target\":\"即使此处没有抛射物，也可在 Lua 中查看 [抛射物]\",\"source_context\":\"\\n\\t-- Generic actions\\n\\tif g and g.change_level and self.on_player then list[#list+1] = {name=_t\\\"Change level\\\", action=\\\"change_level\\\", color=colors.simple(colors.VIOLET)} end\\n\\tif o and self.on_player then list[#list+1] = {name=_t\\\"Pickup item\\\", action=\\\"pickup\\\", color=colors.simple(colors.ANTIQUE_WHITE)} end\\n\\tif g and not self.on_player then list[#list+1] = {name=_t\\\"Move to\\\", action=\\\"move_to\\\", color=colors.simple(colors.ANTIQUE_WHITE)} end\\n\\tif a and not self.on_player and game.party:canControl(a, false) then list[#list+1] = {name=_t\\\"Control\\\", action=\\\"control\\\", color=colors.simple(colors.TEAL), actor=a} end\\n\\tif a and not self.on_player and game.party:canOrder(a, false) then list[#list+1] = {name=_t\\\"Give order\\\", action=\\\"order\\\", color=colors.simple(colors.TEAL), actor=a} end\\n\\n\\tif a and not self.on_player and config.settings.cheat then list[#list+1] = {name=_t\\\"Target player\\\", action=\\\"target-player\\\", color=colors.simple(colors.RED), actor=a} end\\n\\tif a and config.settings.cheat then list[#list+1] = {name=_t\\\"Lua inspect [Actor]\\\", action=\\\"debug-inspect\\\", color=colors.simple(colors.LIGHT_BLUE), actor=a} end\\n\\tif g and config.settings.cheat then list[#list+1] = {name=_t\\\"Lua inspect [Terrain]\\\", action=\\\"debug-inspect\\\", color=colors.simple(colors.LIGHT_BLUE), actor=g} end\\n\\tif t and config.settings.cheat then list[#list+1] = {name=_t\\\"Lua inspect [Trap]\\\", action=\\\"debug-inspect\\\", color=colors.simple(colors.LIGHT_BLUE), actor=t} end\\n\\tif p and config.settings.cheat then list[#list+1] = {name=_t\\\"[[SOURCE_MATCH_1]]\\\", action=\\\"debug-inspect\\\", color=colors.simple(colors.LIGHT_BLUE), actor=p} end\\n\\tif a and config.settings.cheat then list[#list+1] = {name=_t\\\"Show inventory\\\", action=\\\"debug-inventory\\\", color=colors.simple(colors.YELLOW), actor=a} end\\n\\n\\tif self.on_player then list[#list+1] = {name=_t\\\"Rest a while\\\", action=\\\"rest\\\", color=colors.simple(colors.ANTIQUE_WHITE)} end\\n\\tif self.on_player then list[#list+1] = {name=_t\\\"Auto-explore\\\", action=\\\"autoexplore\\\", color=colors.simple(colors.ANTIQUE_WHITE)} end\\n\\tif self.on_player then list[#list+1] = {name=_t\\\"Inventory\\\", action=\\\"inventory\\\", color=colors.simple(colors.ANTIQUE_WHITE)} end\\n\\tif self.on_player then list[#list+1] = {name=_t\\\"Quest Log\\\", action=\\\"quests\\\", color=colors.simple(colors.ANTIQUE_WHITE)} end\\n\\tif a and game.player:canSee(a) then list[#list+1] = {name=_t\\\"Inspect Creature\\\", action=\\\"character_sheet\\\", color=colors.simple(colors.ANTIQUE_WHITE), actor=a} end\\n\\t\\t-- can add extended inspection commands here by including the start tab with the dialog\\n\\t-- space separating inspect from active actions\\n\\tlist[#list+1] = {name=_t\\\" \\\", action=nil, color=colors.simple(colors.ANTIQUE_WHITE)}\\n\\tif not self.on_player and a and game.player:canSee(a) and profile.auth and profile.hash_valid then list[#list+1] = {name=_t\\\"Link creature in chat\\\", action=\\\"chat-link\\\"} end\\n\\tif self.on_player and (player.unused_stats > 0 or player.unused_talents > 0 or player.unused_generics > 0 or player.unused_talents_types > 0) then list[#list+1] = {name=_t\\\"Levelup!\\\", action=\\\"levelup\\\", color=colors.simple(colors.YELLOW)} end\"},{\"neutral_id\":\"Q059\",\"source\":\"Removed 89 beneficial effects from enemies via Disintegration.\",\"target\":\"必须单次使用裂解清除敌人身上的89个增益效果\",\"source_context\":\"\\t\\tself.nb = (self.nb or 0) + dam\\n\\t\\treturn self.nb > 1000000 and profile.mod.allow_build.mage\\n\\tend,\\n\\ttrack = function(self) return tstring{tostring(math.floor(self.nb or 0)),\\\" / 1000000\\\"} end,\\n}\\nnewAchievement{\\n\\tname = \\\"Lichform\\\",\\n\\tdesc = _t[[Achieved your wild dreams of power and eternal life: you turned into a Lich!]],\\n\\tshow = \\\"name\\\",\\n}\\nnewAchievement{\\n\\tname = \\\"Best album ever!\\\", id = \\\"THE_CURE\\\",\\n\\tdesc = _t[[[[SOURCE_MATCH_1]]]],\\n\\tshow = \\\"full\\\", \\tmode = \\\"player\\\",\\n\\tcan_gain = function(self, who)\\n\\t\\tself.nb = (self.nb or 0) + 1\\n\\t\\tif self.nb >= 89 then return true end\\n\\tend,\\n\\ttrack = function(self) return tstring{tostring(self.nb or 0),\\\" / 89\\\"} end,\\n}\"},{\"neutral_id\":\"Q060\",\"source\":\"Killed oneself as a halfling.\",\"target\":\"选择半身人种族并杀死敌人。\",\"source_context\":\"\\tdesc = _t[[Returned from the dead.]],\\n}\\n\\nnewAchievement{\\n\\tname = \\\"Utterly Destroyed\\\", id = \\\"EIDOLON_DEATH\\\",\\n\\tshow = \\\"name\\\",\\n\\tdesc = _t[[Died on the Eidolon Plane.]],\\n}\\n\\nnewAchievement{\\n\\tname = \\\"Fool of a Took!\\\", id = \\\"HALFLING_SUICIDE\\\",\\n\\tshow = \\\"name\\\",\\n\\tdesc = _t[[[[SOURCE_MATCH_1]]]],\\n\\tcan_gain = function(self, who)\\n\\t\\tif who.descriptor and who.descriptor.race == \\\"Halfling\\\" then return true end\\n\\tend\\n}\\n\\nnewAchievement{\\n\\tname = \\\"Emancipation\\\", id = \\\"EMANCIPATION\\\",\\n\\timage = \\\"npc/alchemist_golem.png\\\",\\n\\tshow = \\\"name\\\", huge=true,\\n\\tdesc = _t[[Had the golem kill a boss while its master was already dead.]],\\n\\tmode = \\\"player\\\",\\n\\tcan_gain = function(self, who, target)\"}]}"}],"timestamp":1787984617188},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Let me go through each item.\n\nQ041: source \"Accept these selections\" (a button label in trap selection dialog). Target \"确认法术选择\" — \"Confirm spell selection\". Issues: \"traps\" translated as \"法术\" (spells) — source context is about traps. Also \"Accept\" → \"确认\" is fine-ish, but \"selections\" of traps → \"法术选择\". FINDING: traps vs spells. Also \"Accept\" means accept these selections; target says \"确认\" which is acceptable-ish. Main defect: traps→法术. claim_type VALUE/OTHER. target_span \"法术选择\", evidence \"Accept these selections\" — the evidence for trap comes from source_context (self.traps_selected, \"Preparing trap\"). Evidence must be verbatim from source or source_context. Use \"traps_selected\" or \"Preparing trap with normal trigger.\" Better: evidence \"You cannot prepare more than %d traps.\" Use that.\n\nQ042: \"Got to level 10 of the infinite dungeon.\" Target \"到达无尽地下城第10层。\" Accurate. candidates empty.\n\nQ043: \"THAT'S NOT A VERY HERMIT-LIKE ATTITUDE.\" Target \"这可不像我这个隐士该有的态度。\" — \"my hermit attitude\" — source says \"not a very hermit-like attitude\" — target adds \"我这个\" but that's compatible (the speaker is the hermit). Not an objective defect. Empty.\n\nQ044: source \"Have 100 walls...\" target \"让淤泥巢穴中的 200 面墙...\" — 100 vs 200. FINDING. target_span \"200 面墙\", evidence \"Have 100 walls on the sludgenest turn into hostile creatures.\"\n\nQ045: \"But what is all th...\" target \"但是这一切到底是……\" The source is cut off \"what is all th...\" — target conveys. Fine. Empty.\n\nQ046: \"Killed a Bringer of Doom.\" target \"杀死一名厄运行者。\" \"a Bringer of Doom\" — 厄运行者 is a translation choice. Fine. Empty.\n\nQ047: source about \"your fight with the creature carrying it\" — creature carrying the paper. Target: \"看来在你刚才和那个人类搏斗的时候被打碎了\" — \"the human\"? Source doesn't say human; context: spiders, the matriarch spider, Sun Paladin journal. The creature carrying it — target says \"那个人类\" (that human). That's an addition/misidentification: source context indicates spiders (arachnids), not a human. Hmm, but rule 3: new info compatible with visible evidence and not refutable? The context strongly indicates the creature is a spider (the fight with the matriarch spider, journal says spiders). Target says \"人类\" (human) which contradicts context: \"that spider is the matriarch here\". So FINDING: \"creature\" → \"人类\" contradicts context. claim_type REFERENT. target_span \"和那个人类搏斗\", evidence from source_context: \"that spider is the matriarch here\". Also \"被打碎了\" — paper ruined/打碎? \"ruined from your fight\" — target says paper \"被打碎了\" (shattered) — paper being shattered vs ruined; minor. Also translation: \"对大部分埃亚尔野生生命体有效的信息素在'太阳骑士'这种物种的身上被证明无效\" — fine. \"passive study would lead to great loss\" — \"被动的研究会导致巨大的损失\" fine. \"next step of emigration program should be cleaning of local 'sun paladin' nest and establishment of...\" — \"移民计划的下一步是清理...\" fine. Also quotes: uses \"太阳骑士\" with different quote marks — style. Main finding: 人类.\n\nAlso note: \"sun paladin\" translated as \"太阳骑士\" (Sun Knight?) — conventional translation in ToME Chinese is 太阳骑士 actually (Sun Paladin = 太阳骑士). Fine.\n\nQ048: \"Records of Lorekeeper Hadak part three\" → \"博学者哈达克的记录，第三部分\". Fine. Empty.\n\nQ049: source \"When you do a mouse gesture (right click + drag) a color coded trail is displayed.\" Target: \"当你用右键拖动画出鼠标手势时，始终会显示彩色的轨迹提示。\" — adds \"始终\" (always) — is that supported? The option is \"Display mouse gesture trails\" with hide_gestures toggle; description says when you do a gesture a trail is displayed. Adding \"始终\" (always) is an addition not supported... but rule 3: new info compatible and not refutable by evidence? \"always\" — hmm. The description doesn't say always; it's describing the feature. Actually since the setting toggles display, the base description doesn't claim \"always\". Adding \"始终\" could be considered mis-stating? Hmm. Actually since the setting toggles display, the base description doesn't claim \"always\". \"始终\" implies unconditional, which is arguably contradicted by the toggle (hide_gestures disables). But within this item's text alone, is \"always display\" contradicted? The option name is \"Display mouse gesture trails\" with enabled/disabled. It's plausible the intent: when enabled, always display. Hmm, hard. Also \"color coded\" → \"彩色的\" loses \"color coded\" nuance (颜色编码的). Minor. \"轨迹提示\" adds \"提示\" (hint) — minor addition. I'd report UNCERTAIN on \"始终\" as ADDITION/CONDITION. Actually let me think: is it objective? The source says \"a color coded trail is displayed\" conditional on doing a gesture. Target adds \"always\" — that's added info about the display being always. The setting toggles hide_gestures, meaning trails can be hidden. So \"始终会显示\" contradicts the toggle. Evidence: \"config.settings.hide_gestures = not config.settings.hide_gestures\". I'd give FINDING on 始终? Risky. I'll say UNCERTAIN with CONDITION/ADDITION.\n\nQ050: Long fountain text. Check: target adds \"位于德斯镇\" — \"located in Derth town\"?? Source: \"You see here a large, elaborate fountain\" — no location mentioned. Lore name is \"Angolwen Fountain\" (source_context). Target says 德斯镇 (Derth) — contradicts \"Angolwen Fountain\". But 德斯镇 addition: is it refutable by visible evidence? The lore name \"Angolwen Fountain\" indicates it's in Angolwen, not Derth. So ADDITION contradicted by context. FINDING? The source_context shows name = \"Angolwen Fountain\". Derth is a different town. So the addition \"位于德斯镇\" is refuted. FINDING, claim_type ADDITION or REFERENT. target_span \"位于德斯镇\", evidence \"Angolwen Fountain\".\n\nAlso check rest: \"her arms outstretched to welcome all\" → \"她伸展双臂，欢迎所有人\" fine. \"an elf with a tall, elaborate staff\" fine. \"a halfling with a scepter in one hand and a fireball hovering over the other\" → \"一手握着权杖、另一手上方悬浮火球\" fine. \"in small print\" → \"细小字样\" fine. The carvings: \"ALL ARE WELCOME WHO LEARN FROM THE MISTAKES OF THE PAST\" → \"欢迎所有从过去的错误中吸取教训之人\" fine. \"LET THE ARCANE ONCE MORE BE A BOON AND NOT A BANE TO MAJ'EYAL\" → \"愿奥术再度成为马基·埃亚尔的助益，而非灾祸\" fine. \"MAY WE HAVE THE WISDOM TO ONE DAY REUNITE THE WORLD IN SAFETY AND ENLIGHTENMENT\" → fine. \"GATHER HERE IN PEACE TO DISCOVER AND PERFECT THE KNOWLEDGE OF HOW, AND WHEN, TO WEAVE THE WORLD'S FABRIC\" → \"在此和平相聚，探索并完善何时、如何编织世界织物的知识\" — order swapped (when, how → 何时、如何) but fine. \"repeating along the border\" → \"反复雕着一行\" fine-ish.\n\nQ051: source \"If you bring me a gem and a ring\" — target \"如果你给我找来一颗宝石和一枚项链\" — \"ring\" translated as \"项链\" (necklace/amulet)! That's a VALUE error. Then later \"我可以帮你把宝石的力量镶嵌到戒指里去\" uses 戒指. So 项链 is wrong — should be 戒指. FINDING. target_span \"一枚项链\", evidence \"If you bring me a gem and a ring\".\n\nAlso \"you need a quality ring to use a quality gem\" → \"你得寻找高品质的戒指来用于高品质的宝石\" fine. \"The original traits of the ring will be lost\" → fine. \"There is a small fee dependent on the level of the ring\" fine.\n\nQ052: \"But then where are they now if they won?\" → \"兽人是胜利了，但是现在他们又在哪里呢？\" Adds \"兽人\" (orcs) — source \"they\". Context: Sher'Tuls. Adding \"兽人\" — Sher'Tul are not orcs; they're a lost race. Is this refutable by visible evidence? Context talks about Sher'Tuls who fought the gods. Not stated they're orcs. Hmm, \"兽人\" adds a subject not in source. Visible evidence doesn't state they're orcs; can we judge it wrong? Sher'Tul... external knowledge says they're not orcs, but rule says don't rely on external knowledge. Within visible text: \"Those are Sher'Tuls? They fought the gods?!\" — no orc mention. The addition \"兽人\" is new info... can it be judged wrong by visible evidence? Not directly. Rule 3 says new info compatible with evidence and not judgeable-wrong isn't a defect. But adding a subject not present in source is an addition changing meaning — SUBJECT change. The source \"they\" refers to Sher'Tuls; target asserts orcs. Since evidence doesn't identify them as orcs, and it's a substantive addition... I think this qualifies as ADDITION/SUBJECT FINDING since the subject is explicitly added where source had only a pronoun. Hmm, but rule 3 protects compatible additions. Is \"orcs\" compatible? Ambiguous. I'd report UNCERTAIN with claim_type ADDITION.\n\nQ053: source: \"Return in a few days, and I'll have everything prepared.\" Target: \"几天后你回来，我肯定把一切都准备好了\" fine. \"Oh, take this.\" → \"哦，带上这个。\" fine. \"It opens the ruins of Telmur, which the men of Sholtar sealed many years ago.\" → \"它可以打开泰尔玛废墟，那是多年前肖尔塔人封印的地方。\" fine. \"return with it and your odds of surviving our portal attempt will go up drastically\" → \"请帮我带回来，这能大大提高你通过传送门时存活的几率。\" fine. \" Fear not\" fine. Empty.\n\nQ054: \"I cleared the room of death and all I got was this lousy achievement!\" Target: \"我清完“死亡之屋”后发现我只得到了这个无聊的成就！\" fine (meme reference). Empty.\n\nQ055: \"The Right thing to do\" → \"放走鲜血大师才是正确的选择\" — \"released the Blood Master\"?? Source context: id = \"RING_BLOOD_KILL\", desc \"Did the righteous thing in the ring of blood and disposed of the Blood Master.\" So achievement is for KILLING the Blood Master; target says 放走 (release/spare). FINDING, DIRECTION/ACTION. target_span \"放走鲜血大师\", evidence \"disposed of the Blood Master\".\n\nQ056: source mentions \"it's actually a human inside that hulking, worn armor\" — target: \"才发现那副庞大而破旧的战甲里其实装着弗莉吉亚的弟弟。\" — \"Fryjia's brother\"? Source says \"a human\". Context mentions Fryjia and her father (\"You will understand when you meet her father\"), and valfren-defeat: \"Father... *She stands silent*... You win\". So the armored figure is Fryjia's father, not brother. Target says 弟弟 (younger brother). Evidence: \"You will understand when you meet her father.\" and \"Father...\" Hmm — is that enough to establish the figure is the father? The chat id \"valfren-entry\" — Valfren. Fryjia's father is named Valfren presumably. The defeat text: Fryjia says \"Father...\" right after Valfren collapses. That strongly supports father, contradicting 弟弟. But strictly, does evidence prove the human is her father? The sequence: valfren-entry (armor appears), valfren-defeat (Valfren collapses, Fryjia: \"Father... You win... Prepare for your final battle\"). So Valfren = Father. The armored human = Valfren (entry scene). Target says 弟弟 — contradicted. I'd give FINDING? Or UNCERTAIN? The chain is fairly solid within visible text. I'll say FINDING, REFERENT. target_span \"弗莉吉亚的弟弟\", evidence \"Father... #LIGHT_GREEN#*She stands silent for a few seconds*#WHITE# You win\". Hmm, need verbatim evidence from source_context. The line: \"You close your eyes for a brief instant. Fryjia is there when you open them*\\nFather... #LIGHT_GREEN#*She stands silent for a few seconds*#WHITE# You win, @playerdescriptor.race@.\" Use \"Fryjia is there when you open them\" or simpler \"Father... #LIGHT_GREEN#*She stands silent for a few seconds*#WHITE# You win\". Actually simpler: \"You will understand when you meet her father.\" That's verbatim from source_context. Good — combined with \"Valfren collapses as the light returns\". I'll use evidence: \"Valfren collapses as the light returns to this world\" plus... only one evidence string. Use \"You will understand when you meet her father.\" Hmm, that alone doesn't tie the armored figure. Maybe UNCERTAIN is safer? The correction: 战甲里其实是一个人类（弗莉吉亚的父亲）。The visible context: the defeat chat \"valfren-defeat\" says \"Valfren collapses... Fryjia is there... Father... You win\" — implies Valfren is the father and the one defeated. The entry is \"valfren-entry\" describing the armor. So the human in armor = Valfren = Fryjia's father. I'll mark FINDING with evidence \"Valfren collapses as the light returns to this world\" — hmm, that doesn't mention father. Better combined isn't allowed in one string unless contiguous. The contiguous text: \"#LIGHT_GREEN#*Valfren collapses as the light returns to this world.\\n#LIGHT_GREEN#You close your eyes for a brief instant. Fryjia is there when you open them*\\nFather...\" Not contiguous due to newlines but I can include a multi-line verbatim snippet? Evidence must appear verbatim; newlines included. I could use: \"Fryjia is there when you open them*\\nFather...\" — that includes a newline as in the source_context string. The source_context contains \"Fryjia is there when you open them*\\nFather... #LIGHT_GREEN#*She stands silent\". In the JSON it's actual newline. I'll write evidence with \\n: \"Fryjia is there when you open them*\\nFather...\". That's verbatim.\n\nAlso check other parts of Q056: \"a massive battle armor with an equally massive battle axe\" → \"一副同样手持巨大战斧的巨型战甲\" — \"equally massive\" modifies the axe relative to armor; \"同样手持\" is odd but conveys. \"It wasn't there just a second ago.\" → \"一瞬之前那里还空无一物。\" fine. \"f...t...ma....ll...\" → \"弗……特……玛……尔……\" — transliteration addition, fine (interpreted as syllables). \"extreme emotions invading your very soul\" → \"极端的情绪侵入灵魂，将你彻底淹没\" fine. Also missing line? Source lines all present. OK.\n\nQ057: \"Reload/regenerate Zone and level\" → \"重新加载/重新生成地图和角色\" — \"level\" → \"角色\" (character)?? Should be 层/关卡. \"Zone and level\" — 地图和角色 wrong; 角色 = character. FINDING, VALUE. target_span \"地图和角色\", evidence \"Reload/regenerate Zone and level\".\n\nQ058: \"Lua inspect [Projectile]\" → \"即使此处没有抛射物，也可在 Lua 中查看 [抛射物]\" — addition \"即使此处没有抛射物\" (even if no projectile here). Source is just \"Lua inspect [Projectile]\". This is a substantive addition — the menu item only appears when there is a projectile (if p and config.settings.cheat). So the claim \"even if there's no projectile here\" is contradicted: the entry only appears if p exists. Evidence: \"if p and config.settings.cheat then list[#list+1] = {name=_t\\\"[[SOURCE_MATCH_1]]\\\"...\". FINDING, ADDITION/CONDITION. target_span \"即使此处没有抛射物，也可\", correction \"在 Lua 中查看 [抛射物]\". Evidence: \"if p and config.settings.cheat then\".\n\nQ059: \"Removed 89 beneficial effects from enemies via Disintegration.\" → \"必须单次使用裂解清除敌人身上的89个增益效果\" — adds \"必须单次\" (must in a single use). Source context: can_gain increments nb, track \" / 89\" — cumulative counter, not single use. So \"单次\" is wrong; it's cumulative. Evidence: \"self.nb = (self.nb or 0) + 1\" and track showing cumulative. FINDING, CONDITION/ADDITION. target_span \"必须单次\", evidence \"self.nb = (self.nb or 0) + 1\". Also \"Removed 89\" stated as achievement desc — target phrase \"必须...清除\" turns into requirement; that's a statement change but the desc is descriptive; the 单次 is the key objective defect. Also could note the descriptive→imperative but skip.\n\nQ060: \"Killed oneself as a halfling.\" → \"选择半身人种族并杀死敌人。\" — \"killed oneself\" (suicide) vs \"杀死敌人\" (kill enemies). Achievement \"Fool of a Took!\" id HALFLING_SUICIDE. FINDING, ACTION/DIRECTION. target_span \"并杀死敌人\", evidence \"Killed oneself as a halfling.\" Also \"选择半身人种族\" for \"as a halfling\" — okay. Main: suicide→kill enemy.\n\nNow Q041 more precisely: \"Accept these selections\" — in trap preparation dialog. Target \"确认法术选择\" — \"确认\" for Accept fine; \"法术\" for traps wrong. Also \"these selections\" → \"选择\" fine. FINDING: 法术 vs 陷阱. claim_type VALUE (or REFERENT). evidence: \"You cannot prepare more than %d traps.\" or \"self.traps_selected\". Use \"You cannot prepare more than %d traps.\"\n\nQ049 decision: I'll include UNCERTAIN candidate for 始终, and maybe also \"提示\" addition? That's trivial; skip. Also \"color coded\" → 彩色的: loses \"color coded\" meaning; colors code something. \"彩色的轨迹提示\" — minor. Skip or UNCERTAIN? I'll skip to keep focused; actually it is a small omission of \"coded\". Skip.\n\nQ047: Also \"creature carrying it\" — the paper; target \"在你刚才和那个人类搏斗的时候被打碎了\" — subject shifted to the paper being shattered, and creature → 人类. I'll report the 人类 one. Also maybe \"被打碎了\" — \"ruined\" → 被打碎; paper shattered — minor, skip.\n\nAlso Q047 target: \"对大部分埃亚尔野生生命体有效的信息素在'太阳骑士'这种物种的身上被证明无效\" — source: \"pheromone signals effective on much Eyalite wildlife ineffective on species 'sun paladin.'\" fine. \"next step ... should be cleaning of local 'sun paladin' nest and establishment of...\" → \"移民计划的下一步是清理本地的'太阳骑士'巢穴并建立…\" — \"establishment of...\" truncated, \"并建立…\" ok.\n\nQ043: also check \"这可不像我这个隐士该有的态度\" vs \"THAT'S NOT A VERY HERMIT-LIKE ATTITUDE.\" Fine.\n\nQ052: Let me decide. The target adds 兽人. Source: player asks \"But then where are they now if they won?\" after being told about Sher'Tuls. The NPC says \"They are gone now.\" Adding \"兽人\" as subject — visible evidence never says Sher'Tuls are orcs. Given rule 3, additions not judgeable-wrong are okay, but this one asserts a specific race identity. I'll report UNCERTAIN, ADDITION. Actually hmm — in ToME lore, Sher'Tul are not orcs; orc pride lore is separate in this file (Q048 context is orc history). But external knowledge not allowed. Within visible text, nothing contradicts or confirms. UNCERTAIN.\n\nQ050 德斯镇: evidence \"Angolwen Fountain\" — solid FINDING.\n\nNow compose JSON with 20 items Q041–Q060, each with observation.\n\nLet me write observations concisely (Chinese fine).\n\nItems with empty candidates: Q042, Q043, Q045, Q046, Q048, Q053, Q054.\n\nFINDINGS: Q041, Q044, Q047, Q050, Q051, Q055, Q057, Q058, Q059, Q060. UNCERTAIN: Q049, Q052, Q056(FINDING).\n\nQ056 verdict: I'll go FINDING.\n\nEvidence strings verbatim check:\n\nQ041 evidence: \"You cannot prepare more than %d traps.\" — present in source_context. Good.\n\nQ044 evidence: \"Have 100 walls on the sludgenest turn into hostile creatures.\" — present verbatim in source_context. Good.\n\nQ047 evidence: \"that spider is the matriarch here\" — verbatim in source_context (\"that spider is the matriarch here\"). Yes.\n\nQ050 evidence: \"Angolwen Fountain\" — verbatim. Good.\n\nQ051 evidence: \"If you bring me a gem and a ring\" — verbatim in source. Yes.\n\nQ055 evidence: \"disposed of the Blood Master\" — verbatim. Good.\n\nQ057 evidence: \"Reload/regenerate Zone and level\" — source. Good.\n\nQ058 evidence: \"if p and config.settings.cheat then list[#list+1] = {name=_t\\\"[[SOURCE_MATCH_1]]\\\"\" — verbatim? source_context: \"if p and config.settings.cheat then list[#list+1] = {name=_t\\\"[[SOURCE_MATCH_1]]\\\", action=\\\"debug-inspect\\\"...\" — In JSON the quote is escaped \\\" but the actual string contains \". I'll write: \"if p and config.settings.cheat then\" — simpler, verbatim.\n\nQ059 evidence: \"self.nb = (self.nb or 0) + 1\" — verbatim. Also could use track \"/ 89\". Use \"self.nb = (self.nb or 0) + 1\".\n\nQ060 evidence: \"Killed oneself as a halfling.\" — source verbatim.\n\nQ049 evidence: \"config.settings.hide_gestures = not config.settings.hide_gestures\" — verbatim.\n\nQ052: no evidence pinpoints orc; but evidence field required. Use source text \"But then where are they now if they won?\" and context \"Those are Sher'Tuls? They fought the gods?!\" as evidence showing subject is Sher'Tul. Use that.\n\nQ056 evidence: \"Fryjia is there when you open them*\\nFather...\" — the source_context has \"*She stands silent...\" hmm the exact: \"Fryjia is there when you open them*\\nFather... #LIGHT_GREEN#*She stands silent for a few seconds*#WHITE# You win, @playerdescriptor.race@.\" So evidence string \"Fryjia is there when you open them*\\nFather...\" with actual newline. In JSON output I'd write \"Fryjia is there when you open them*\\nFather...\". Fine.\n\nAlso for Q049, target_span \"始终会显示\" — verbatim in target: \"始终会显示彩色的轨迹提示\" — yes \"始终会显示\".\n\nQ041 target_span \"法术选择\" — verbatim. Correction: \"确认陷阱选择\".\n\nQ044 correction: \"让淤泥巢穴中的 100 面墙变成敌对生物。\"\n\nQ047 correction: \"看来在你刚才和那只生物搏斗的时候被打碎了\" — better: \"看来在你刚才和携带它的生物搏斗的时候被打碎了\". claim_type REFERENT.\n\nQ050 correction: \"（你在此看到一座庞大而精致的喷泉。...\"\n\nQ051 correction: \"一枚戒指\".\n\nQ055 correction: \"击杀鲜血大师才是正确的选择\". claim_type DIRECTION (reversed action). target_span \"放走鲜血大师\".\n\nQ057 correction: \"重新加载/重新生成区域和关卡\". claim_type VALUE. target_span \"地图和角色\".\n\nQ058 correction: \"在 Lua 中查看 [抛射物]\". claim_type ADDITION (or CONDITION). target_span \"即使此处没有抛射物，也可\".\n\nQ059 correction: \"通过裂解清除敌人身上的89个增益效果\" (remove 必须单次). target_span \"必须单次\". claim_type CONDITION.\n\nQ060 correction: \"选择半身人种族并杀死自己。\" claim_type DIRECTION. target_span \"并杀死敌人\".\n\nQ049 correction: remove 始终: \"当你用右键拖动画出鼠标手势时，会显示颜色编码的轨迹。#WHITE#\". verdict UNCERTAIN, claim_type ADDITION.\n\nQ052 correction: \"它们胜利了，但是现在它们又在哪里呢？\" verdict UNCERTAIN, claim_type ADDITION.\n\nQ056 correction: \"才发现那副庞大而破旧的战甲里其实是一个人类。\" claim_type REFERENT.\n\nOrder Q041..Q060. Output JSON only.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"```json\n{\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"Q041\",\n      \"candidates\": [\n        {\n          \"verdict\": \"FINDING\",\n          \"claim_type\": \"VALUE\",\n          \"target_span\": \"法术选择\",\n          \"correction\": \"确认陷阱选择\",\n          \"evidence\": \"You cannot prepare more than %d traps.\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"observation\": \"该界面为陷阱布置选择（source_context 中出现 traps_selected、preparing trap 等证据），source 的 selections 指陷阱选择；target 误译为“法术选择”。\"\n    },\n    {\n     