\"correction\": \"当你用右键拖动画出鼠标手势时，会显示颜色编码的轨迹。#WHITE#\",\n          \"evidence\": \"config.settings.hide_gestures = not config.settings.hide_gestures\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"observation\": \"source 只说做手势时会显示轨迹，未说“始终”显示；且该选项通过 hide_gestures 开关控制可禁用，“始终”为额外添加的条件，但开关语义存在一定解释空间，故列为 UNCERTAIN。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"Q050\",\n      \"candidates\": [\n        {\n          \"verdict\": \"FINDING\",\n          \"claim_type\": \"ADDITION\",\n          \"target_span\": \"位于德斯镇\",\n          \"correction\": \"（你在此看到一座庞大而精致的喷泉。\",\n          \"evidence\": \"Angolwen Fountain\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"observation\": \"source 未提及喷泉所在地点；source_context 中该文本的名称为 “Angolwen Fountain”（安戈尔wen 喷泉），target 添加“位于德斯镇”与可见证据相矛盾。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"Q051\",\n      \"candidates\": [\n        {\n          \"verdict\": \"FINDING\",\n          \"claim_type\": \"VALUE\",\n          \"target_span\": \"一枚项链\",\n          \"correction\": \"一枚戒指\",\n          \"evidence\": \"If you bring me a gem and a ring\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"observation\": \"source 明确要求带来 “a gem and a ring”（宝石和戒指），target 误译为“项链”，且与同句后文的“镶嵌到戒指里”自相矛盾。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"Q052\",\n      \"candidates\": [\n        {\n          \"verdict\": \"UNCERTAIN\",\n          \"claim_type\": \"ADDITION\",\n          \"target_span\": \"兽人\",\n          \"correction\": \"它们是胜利了，但是现在它们又在哪里呢？\",\n          \"evidence\": \"Those are Sher'Tuls? They fought the gods?!\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"observation\": \"source 仅用代词 “they”，指代前文谈及的 Sher'Tuls；target 明确补出主语“兽人”。可见文本中未说明 Sher'Tuls 是兽人，该主语为新增信息，证据不足以确证为错，列为 UNCERTAIN。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"Q053\",\n      \"candidates\": [],\n      \"observation\": \"钥匙、泰尔玛废墟的封印、《反转与复原概率场》文献及存活几率提升等信息在 target 中均完整、准确对应，无客观缺陷。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"Q054\",\n      \"candidates\": [],\n      \"observation\": \"“我清完‘死亡之屋’后发现我只得到了这个无聊的成就！”忠实传达了原句的自嘲语气和内容，无客观缺陷。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"Q055\",\n      \"candidates\": [\n        {\n          \"verdict\": \"FINDING\",\n          \"claim_type\": \"DIRECTION\",\n          \"target_span\": \"放走鲜血大师\",\n          \"correction\": \"击杀鲜血大师才是正确的选择\",\n          \"evidence\": \"disposed of the Blood Master\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"observation\": \"该成就（id=RING_BLOOD_KILL）的描述为 “disposed of the Blood Master”（除掉鲜血大师），target 译为“放走鲜血大师”，动作方向完全相反。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"Q056\",\n      \"candidates\": [\n        {\n          \"verdict\": \"FINDING\",\n          \"claim_type\": \"REFERENT\",\n          \"target_span\": \"弗莉吉亚的弟弟\",\n          \"correction\": \"才发现那副庞大而破旧的战甲里其实是一个人类。\",\n          \"evidence\": \"Fryjia is there when you open them*\\nFather...\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"observation\": \"source 明确说战甲里是 “a human”；source_context 中战败场景（valfren-defeat）显示 Valfren 倒下后弗莉吉亚称其为 “Father”，可见证据指向此人是弗莉吉亚的父亲，target 改为“弟弟”与证据相矛盾。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"Q057\",\n      \"candidates\": [\n        {\n          \"verdict\": \"FINDING\",\n          \"claim_type\": \"VALUE\",\n          \"target_span\": \"地图和角色\",\n          \"correction\": \"重新加载/重新生成区域和关卡\",\n          \"evidence\": \"Reload/regenerate Zone and level\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"observation\": \"source 的 “Zone and level” 指区域和关卡层级，target 误译为“角色”，对象错误（该功能对应 ReloadZone）。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"Q058\",\n      \"candidates\": [\n        {\n          \"verdict\": \"FINDING\",\n          \"claim_type\": \"ADDITION\",\n          \"target_span\": \"即使此处没有抛射物，也可\",\n          \"correction\": \"在 Lua 中查看 [抛射物]\",\n          \"evidence\": \"if p and config.settings.cheat then\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"observation\": \"source 仅为菜单项 “Lua inspect [Projectile]”；按 source_context，该菜单项仅在实际存在抛射物（p）且开启作弊时才会添加，target 添加的“即使此处没有抛射物，也可”与代码逻辑相矛盾。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"Q059\",\n      \"candidates\": [\n        {\n          \"verdict\": \"FINDING\",\n          \"claim_type\": \"CONDITION\",\n          \"target_span\": \"必须单次\",\n          \"correction\": \"通过裂解清除敌人身上的89个增益效果\",\n          \"evidence\": \"self.nb = (self.nb or 0) + 1\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"observation\": \"source_context 显示计数器为累计式（每次 +1，进度 “ / 89”），并非要求单次完成；target 添加“必须单次”与可见证据相矛盾。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"Q060\",\n      \"candidates\": [\n        {\n          \"verdict\": \"FINDING\",\n          \"claim_type\": \"DIRECTION\",\n          \"target_span\": \"并杀死敌人\",\n          \"correction\": \"选择半身人种族并杀死自己。\",\n          \"evidence\": \"Killed oneself as a halfling.\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"observation\": \"source 描述的是半身人自杀（成就 “Fool of a Took!”，id=HALFLING_SUICIDE），target 译为“杀死敌人”，动作对象完全相反。\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"zai-standard-cn","model":"glm-5.3-flash","usage":{"input":10810,"output":7947,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"reasoning":5724,"totalTokens":18757,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1787984617206,"responseId":"202608291423372cc52b1fbf404b0f","rawStopReason":"stop"}],"willRetry":false}
